msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DistanceMetric|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to name the similarity function under which a vector space is meaningful."
msgstr "用于命名使某个向量空间有意义的相似度函数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DistanceMetric|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the metric as an implementation detail or defaulting it silently — cosine and euclidean disagree about what is near."
msgstr "避免把度量当作实现细节或静默取默认值——余弦与欧氏对“接近”的判断并不一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DistanceMetric|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach one of gmeow:distanceMetricCosine / DotProduct / Euclidean with gmeow:distanceMetric; the vocabulary is open."
msgstr "通过 gmeow:distanceMetric 关联 gmeow:distanceMetricCosine / DotProduct / Euclidean；该词汇是开放的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DistanceMetric|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:distanceMetricCosine a gmeow:DistanceMetric ."
msgstr "示例：gmeow:distanceMetricCosine a gmeow:DistanceMetric ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Embedding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for one vector representation of one information object under one model."
msgstr "用于表示某一模型下对某一信息对象的一个向量表示。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Embedding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid merging two models' embeddings of the same chunk into one individual, and avoid using it for the source text itself."
msgstr "避免把两个模型对同一分块的嵌入合并为一个个体，也不要用它表示源文本本身。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Embedding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Give it gmeow:embeddingOf, gmeow:embeddingModel, gmeow:embeddingDimensions and gmeow:distanceMetric; model and metric are provenance, not decoration."
msgstr "为其赋予 gmeow:embeddingOf、gmeow:embeddingModel、gmeow:embeddingDimensions 与 gmeow:distanceMetric；模型与度量属于来源信息，而非点缀。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Embedding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:embedding1 gmeow:embeddingOf gmeow:chunk1 ."
msgstr "gmeow:embedding1 gmeow:embeddingOf gmeow:chunk1 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RetrievalEvent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record one retrieval against a vector index — the answer to why a model saw a passage."
msgstr "用于记录一次针对向量索引的检索——即“模型为何看到该段落”的答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RetrievalEvent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using it for the generation step that consumed the results, and avoid one event for a federated fan-out — that is several events under one parent activity."
msgstr "不要用它表示消费检索结果的生成步骤，也不要用单个事件表示联邦扇出检索——那是同一父活动下的多个事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RetrievalEvent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Give it gmeow:againstIndex and the chunks returned; an agent-memory recall is a RetrievalEvent too."
msgstr "为其赋予 gmeow:againstIndex 及返回的分块；智能体记忆召回同样是一次 RetrievalEvent。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RetrievalEvent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:retrieval1 gmeow:againstIndex gmeow:index1 ."
msgstr "gmeow:retrieval1 gmeow:againstIndex gmeow:index1 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/VectorIndex|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for a built retrieval structure over a corpus's embeddings — the artifact a retrieval queries."
msgstr "用于表示在语料嵌入之上构建的检索结构——检索所查询的工件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/VectorIndex|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid conflating it with the embeddings it indexes or with the corpus itself, and avoid omitting its metric."
msgstr "避免将其与所索引的嵌入或语料本身混为一谈，也不要省略其度量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/VectorIndex|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Carry its algorithm, its parameters verbatim for reproducibility, and gmeow:distanceMetric."
msgstr "记录其算法、逐字保留的参数（以便复现）以及 gmeow:distanceMetric。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/VectorIndex|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:index1 gmeow:distanceMetric gmeow:distanceMetricCosine ."
msgstr "gmeow:index1 gmeow:distanceMetric gmeow:distanceMetricCosine ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/againstIndex|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to name the one index a retrieval queried."
msgstr "用于命名某次检索所查询的那一个索引。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/againstIndex|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using it for a federated fan-out; it is functional, so several indexes mean several RetrievalEvents."
msgstr "不要用于联邦扇出；该属性是函数性的，多个索引意味着多个 RetrievalEvent。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/againstIndex|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach exactly one gmeow:VectorIndex to a gmeow:RetrievalEvent."
msgstr "为一个 gmeow:RetrievalEvent 恰好关联一个 gmeow:VectorIndex。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/againstIndex|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:retrieval1 gmeow:againstIndex gmeow:index1 ."
msgstr "gmeow:retrieval1 gmeow:againstIndex gmeow:index1 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetric|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record the similarity function under which an embedding or index is meaningful."
msgstr "用于记录使某个嵌入或索引有意义的相似度函数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetric|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid leaving it implicit or assuming a default — the metric is provenance, and consumers cannot recover it."
msgstr "避免将其隐含或假定默认值——度量属于来源信息，消费方无法自行还原。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetric|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Domain-free: carry it on gmeow:Embedding and gmeow:VectorIndex alike, with a gmeow:DistanceMetric value."
msgstr "不限定域：可同样用于 gmeow:Embedding 与 gmeow:VectorIndex，取值为 gmeow:DistanceMetric。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetric|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:embedding1 gmeow:distanceMetric gmeow:distanceMetricCosine ."
msgstr "gmeow:embedding1 gmeow:distanceMetric gmeow:distanceMetricCosine ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricCosine|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when angle between vectors is what matters and magnitude should be ignored."
msgstr "当关注向量夹角而应忽略模长时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricCosine|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid mixing it with another metric across one index, and avoid asserting it where the metric was never actually configured."
msgstr "避免在同一索引中混用不同度量，也不要在实际未配置度量之处断言它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricCosine|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach it with gmeow:distanceMetric to a gmeow:Embedding or a gmeow:VectorIndex."
msgstr "通过 gmeow:distanceMetric 关联到 gmeow:Embedding 或 gmeow:VectorIndex。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricCosine|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:distanceMetricCosine a gmeow:DistanceMetric ."
msgstr "示例：gmeow:distanceMetricCosine a gmeow:DistanceMetric ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricDotProduct|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when magnitude carries signal, as with normalized embeddings."
msgstr "当模长本身携带信息（例如归一化嵌入）时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricDotProduct|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid mixing it with another metric across one index, and avoid asserting it where the metric was never actually configured."
msgstr "避免在同一索引中混用不同度量，也不要在实际未配置度量之处断言它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricDotProduct|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach it with gmeow:distanceMetric to a gmeow:Embedding or a gmeow:VectorIndex."
msgstr "通过 gmeow:distanceMetric 关联到 gmeow:Embedding 或 gmeow:VectorIndex。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricDotProduct|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:distanceMetricDotProduct a gmeow:DistanceMetric ."
msgstr "示例：gmeow:distanceMetricDotProduct a gmeow:DistanceMetric ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricEuclidean|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when straight-line L2 distance is the intended notion of near."
msgstr "当以直线 L2 距离作为“接近”的定义时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricEuclidean|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid mixing it with another metric across one index, and avoid asserting it where the metric was never actually configured."
msgstr "避免在同一索引中混用不同度量，也不要在实际未配置度量之处断言它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricEuclidean|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach it with gmeow:distanceMetric to a gmeow:Embedding or a gmeow:VectorIndex."
msgstr "通过 gmeow:distanceMetric 关联到 gmeow:Embedding 或 gmeow:VectorIndex。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/distanceMetricEuclidean|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:distanceMetricEuclidean a gmeow:DistanceMetric ."
msgstr "示例：gmeow:distanceMetricEuclidean a gmeow:DistanceMetric ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingDimensions|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record the dimensionality of the embedding vector."
msgstr "用于记录嵌入向量的维数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingDimensions|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring it from the model name, and avoid recording it on the index instead of the embedding."
msgstr "避免根据模型名称推断，也不要把它记在索引上而非嵌入上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingDimensions|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "A plain integer literal on a gmeow:Embedding."
msgstr "在 gmeow:Embedding 上以普通整数字面量表示。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingDimensions|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:embedding1 gmeow:embeddingDimensions 1536 ."
msgstr "gmeow:embedding1 gmeow:embeddingDimensions 1536 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingModel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to attribute an embedding to the model agent that produced it."
msgstr "用于将嵌入归属于产生它的模型智能体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingModel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid merging two models' embeddings of one chunk — machine-derived values are attributed, so they are two individuals."
msgstr "避免合并两个模型对同一分块的嵌入——机器派生值需标注归属，因此它们是两个个体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingModel|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Name the model agent on the gmeow:Embedding."
msgstr "在 gmeow:Embedding 上命名该模型智能体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingModel|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:embedding1 gmeow:embeddingModel gmeow:model1 ."
msgstr "gmeow:embedding1 gmeow:embeddingModel gmeow:model1 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to name the one information object an embedding represents."
msgstr "用于命名某个嵌入所表示的那一个信息对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid pointing it at a whole document when the embedding is of a chunk; it is functional, so one embedding represents exactly one object."
msgstr "当嵌入对应的是分块时，不要指向整篇文档；该属性是函数性的，一个嵌入恰好表示一个对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach the represented object — usually a gmeow:Chunk — to the gmeow:Embedding."
msgstr "将被表示的对象（通常是 gmeow:Chunk）关联到该 gmeow:Embedding。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/embeddingOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:embedding1 gmeow:embeddingOf gmeow:chunk1 ."
msgstr "gmeow:embedding1 gmeow:embeddingOf gmeow:chunk1 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClaimNeedsEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Claim needs evidence constraint"
msgstr "主张须有证据约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClaimNeedsEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity warning: an LLM-extracted claim (gmeow:observationMethod gmeow:methodLlmExtraction) with no gmeow:groundedIn evidence span is a flagged hallucination — surfaced, retained, never deleted (P10)."
msgstr "闭世界完整性警告：由大语言模型抽取的主张（gmeow:observationMethod gmeow:methodLlmExtraction）若没有任何 gmeow:groundedIn 证据跨度，即是一处被标记的幻觉——予以呈现、予以保留，绝不删除（P10）。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SpanRequiresEndConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Span requires end constraint"
msgstr "跨度须有终点约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/SpanRequiresEndConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: every span carrying a gmeow:spanStart must also carry a gmeow:spanEnd — a span with only one boundary is not a well-formed span."
msgstr "闭世界完整性约束：凡携带 gmeow:spanStart 的跨度都必须同时携带 gmeow:spanEnd——只有单侧边界的跨度不是良构的跨度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingSpanConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Grounding span completeness constraint"
msgstr "支撑跨度完备性约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/GroundingSpanConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: every span reached via gmeow:groundedIn from a claim (a grounding span) must be pinned into a chunk (gmeow:spanOfChunk), offset-located (gmeow:spanStart, gmeow:spanEnd), and polarity-classified (gmeow:supportPolarity) — evidence without recoverable, offset-located, polarity-classified bytes is a vibe, not grounding."
msgstr "闭世界完整性约束：凡从主张经 gmeow:groundedIn 到达的跨度（即支撑跨度）都必须锚定到某个分块（gmeow:spanOfChunk）、以偏移量定位（gmeow:spanStart、gmeow:spanEnd）并按极性归类（gmeow:supportPolarity）——字节若不可还原、不以偏移定位、未按极性归类，那便只是感觉，而非支撑。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/externalRedactionCount|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "external redaction count"
msgstr "外部删节数量"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/externalRedactionCount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The number of answer items reported redacted for a model invocation."
msgstr "模型调用中报告被删节的回答项目数量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/externalRedactionCount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:call gmeow:externalRedactionCount \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."
msgstr "ex:call gmeow:externalRedactionCount \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/externalRedactionCount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A count of items, not characters or hidden content; explicit zero differs from missing information."
msgstr "这是项目数，不是字符数或隐藏内容；明确的零不同于信息缺失。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/externalRedactionCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not replace the original prompt, requested alias, actual model and attributed answer with one unstructured invocation string."
msgstr "不要将原始提示、请求别名、实际模型和有归属的回答替换为一个无结构的调用字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/externalRedactionCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep hasPrompt, usedModel and the output’s wasGeneratedBy/wasAttributedTo provenance; reach answer content through observationResult."
msgstr "保留 hasPrompt、usedModel 以及输出的 wasGeneratedBy/wasAttributedTo 来源；通过 observationResult 获取回答内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/externalRedactionCount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when preserving what was asked and answered without treating generated words as established facts."
msgstr "用于保留所问与所答，同时不将生成文字视为已确立事实时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/promptText|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "prompt text"
msgstr "提示文本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/promptText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original words of a concrete prompt presented to a model."
msgstr "提交给模型的具体提示的原始文字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/promptText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:question gmeow:promptText \"What did you observe?\"@en ."
msgstr "提问要求说明观察到了什么：`ex:question gmeow:promptText \"What did you observe?\"@en .`"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/promptText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Retain language and direction where supplied; a text rendering does not replace the exact-byte content digest."
msgstr "如有提供，应保留语言与方向；文本呈现不能替代精确字节的内容摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/promptText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not replace the original prompt, requested alias, actual model and attributed answer with one unstructured invocation string."
msgstr "不要将原始提示、请求别名、实际模型和有归属的回答替换为一个无结构的调用字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/promptText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep hasPrompt, usedModel and the output’s wasGeneratedBy/wasAttributedTo provenance; reach answer content through observationResult."
msgstr "保留 hasPrompt、usedModel 以及输出的 wasGeneratedBy/wasAttributedTo 来源；通过 observationResult 获取回答内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/promptText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when preserving what was asked and answered without treating generated words as established facts."
msgstr "用于保留所问与所答，同时不将生成文字视为已确立事实时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelAlias|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "requested model alias"
msgstr "所请求的模型别名"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelAlias|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The provider model name or alias requested for a model invocation before resolution to the actual model."
msgstr "模型调用在解析到实际模型之前向提供方请求的模型名称或别名。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelAlias|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:call gmeow:modelAlias \"provider/latest\"^^xsd:token ."
msgstr "ex:call gmeow:modelAlias \"provider/latest\"^^xsd:token ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelAlias|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The requested token is provenance; usedModel still names the actual model agent."
msgstr "请求词元属于来源信息；usedModel 仍指向实际使用的模型行动者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelAlias|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not replace the original prompt, requested alias, actual model and attributed answer with one unstructured invocation string."
msgstr "不要将原始提示、请求别名、实际模型和有归属的回答替换为一个无结构的调用字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelAlias|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep hasPrompt, usedModel and the output’s wasGeneratedBy/wasAttributedTo provenance; reach answer content through observationResult."
msgstr "保留 hasPrompt、usedModel 以及输出的 wasGeneratedBy/wasAttributedTo 来源；通过 observationResult 获取回答内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelAlias|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when preserving what was asked and answered without treating generated words as established facts."
msgstr "用于保留所问与所答，同时不将生成文字视为已确立事实时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/answerText|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "answer text"
msgstr "回答文本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/answerText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original words of an answer retained as an information object."
msgstr "作为信息对象保留的回答原始文字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/answerText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:answer gmeow:answerText \"I could not verify it.\"@en ."
msgstr "回答说明无法核实：`ex:answer gmeow:answerText \"I could not verify it.\"@en .`"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/answerText|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Text is attributed content, not an asserted triple or proof of what it says; preserve language and direction."
msgstr "文本是有归属的内容，不是断言的三元组，也不证明其所述内容；应保留语言与方向。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/answerText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not replace the original prompt, requested alias, actual model and attributed answer with one unstructured invocation string."
msgstr "不要将原始提示、请求别名、实际模型和有归属的回答替换为一个无结构的调用字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/answerText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep hasPrompt, usedModel and the output’s wasGeneratedBy/wasAttributedTo provenance; reach answer content through observationResult."
msgstr "保留 hasPrompt、usedModel 以及输出的 wasGeneratedBy/wasAttributedTo 来源；通过 observationResult 获取回答内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/answerText|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when preserving what was asked and answered without treating generated words as established facts."
msgstr "用于保留所问与所答，同时不将生成文字视为已确立事实时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetDecisionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "labelSetDecision is functional"
msgstr "labelSetDecision 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetDecisionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:labelSetDecision is functional: a registered label set carries exactly one decision structure — argmax-exclusive or independent-threshold — because a set that was simultaneously single-label and multi-label would make its exclusivity, and hence whether a second label crossing is a violation, undecidable. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:labelSetDecision 是函数式的:一个已注册的标签集恰好携带一种决策结构——argmax 互斥式或独立阈值式——因为一个同时既是单标签又是多标签的集合,会使其互斥性、进而使第二个标签越界是否构成违规都变得不可判定。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelIdentifierFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "modelIdentifier is functional"
msgstr "modelIdentifier 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelIdentifierFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:modelIdentifier is functional: an inference run executes exactly one pinned model repository id, so a run naming two model ids would not identify a single reproducible execution."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:modelIdentifier 是函数式的:一次推理运行恰好执行一个被锁定的模型仓库标识,因此一次运行若指名两个模型标识,就无法标识出单一的可复现执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelRevisionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "modelRevision is functional"
msgstr "modelRevision 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelRevisionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:modelRevision is functional: a run pins exactly one model revision/commit — the single most drift-prone coordinate of its reproducible identity — so two revisions on one run would name two different models rather than one execution."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:modelRevision 是函数式的:一次运行恰好锁定一个模型修订版本/提交——这是其可复现身份中最易漂移的坐标——因此同一次运行上的两个修订版本将指向两个不同的模型,而不是一次执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/producedByFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "producedBy is functional"
msgstr "producedBy 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreSemanticsFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "scoreSemantics is functional"
msgstr "scoreSemantics 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreSemanticsFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:scoreSemantics is functional: a classifier score has exactly one declared meaning — sigmoid, softmax probability, calibrated probability, logit, or margin — because one number cannot be two of those at once without becoming uninterpretable."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:scoreSemantics 是函数性的:一个分类器分数恰好具有一种声明的含义——sigmoid、softmax 概率、校准概率、logit 或间隔(margin)——因为同一个数字若同时是其中两种,就会变得无法解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetDecisionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:labelSetDecision names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:labelSetDecision 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetDecisionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetDecisionFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:labelSetDecision, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:labelSetDecision, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetDecisionFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:labelSetDecisionFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:labelSetDecision ."
msgstr "gmeow:labelSetDecisionFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:labelSetDecision ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelIdentifierFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:modelIdentifier names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
