msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClassifierLabel|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Classifier Label"
msgstr "分类器标签"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClassifierLabel|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact external label identity in a classifier label set. This information artifact is distinct from a canonical category; identical words in different registries or run-scoped candidate sets do not identify the same label."
msgstr "分类器标签集中的确切外部标签标识。此信息制品有别于规范类别；不同注册表或不同运行范围候选集中的相同词语并不标识同一标签。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClassifierOutput|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Classifier Output"
msgstr "分类器输出"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClassifierOutput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One attributed classifier result for one target and exact emitted label, retaining its raw decimal score, declared score semantics and producing ModelInferenceRun record. Model evidence does not entail membership in a canonical domain category."
msgstr "针对一个目标和一个确切输出标签的归属明确的分类器结果，保留原始十进制分数、声明的分数语义及产生结果的 ModelInferenceRun 记录。模型证据不蕴含规范领域类别成员关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClassifierLabelSet|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Classifier Label Set"
msgstr "分类器标签集"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClassifierLabelSet|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An identified external label vocabulary, either a static registry or a run-scoped zero-shot candidate set. Members are ClassifierLabel artifacts, not canonical domain categories. Static registries used by the affect producer require a reviewed decision rule; run-scoped candidate sets may legitimately lack one."
msgstr "具有标识的外部标签词表，可以是静态注册表或运行范围的零样本候选集。成员是 ClassifierLabel 制品，而非规范领域类别。情感生产器使用的静态注册表需要经审查的决策规则；运行范围候选集可合法地缺少该规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ModelInferenceRun|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Model Inference Run"
msgstr "模型推理运行记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ModelInferenceRun|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The enduring provenance record of one classifier execution, not the execution activity. It pins the model identifier and exact revision and captures task, framework, tokenizer and label-set revisions, inputs and hypothesis template. It may serve as an Observation vantage. A real generating Activity is distinct and may generate the record through wasGeneratedBy; producedBy points to the record."
msgstr "一次分类器执行的持久来源记录，而非执行活动本身。它固定模型标识和确切版本，并捕获任务、框架、分词器与标签集版本、输入及假设模板。它可充当 Observation 的观察立场。真实的生成 Activity 与其区分，可通过 wasGeneratedBy 生成记录；producedBy 指向记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ScoreSemantics|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Score Semantics"
msgstr "分数语义"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ScoreSemantics|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An open vocabulary declaring the interpretation of a raw classifier score. Calibration and probability do not by themselves establish epistemic confidence or provenance-derived evidence strength; each requires a separately justified mapping."
msgstr "声明分类器原始分数解释的开放词表。校准与概率本身不确立认知置信度或来源推导的证据强度；各自都需要单独论证的映射。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/LabelSetDecisionRule|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Label Set Decision Rule"
msgstr "标签集决策规则"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/LabelSetDecisionRule|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An open vocabulary of declared score-to-decision policies over a label set. Argmax and independent thresholding are distinct policies, coupled to compatible score semantics through impliesLabelSetDecision."
msgstr "标签集上声明的分数到决策策略的开放词表。最大值选择与独立阈值是不同策略，通过 impliesLabelSetDecision 连接兼容的分数语义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/classifiedTarget|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "classified target"
msgstr "分类目标"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/classifiedTarget|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The target classified by this output, bridged to observedFeature. The target may be a document, span, media segment or other feature of interest."
msgstr "此输出分类的目标，桥接到 observedFeature。目标可以是文档、文本片段、媒体片段或其他关注对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/classifierScore|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "classifier score"
msgstr "分类器分数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/classifierScore|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact raw decimal score emitted for this label, interpreted only under scoreSemantics. No universal unit interval, probability, confidence or evidential-warrant interpretation is inferred."
msgstr "为此标签输出的确切原始十进制分数，仅按 scoreSemantics 解释。不推断通用单位区间、概率、置信度或证据论据含义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/emittedLabel|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "emitted label"
msgstr "输出标签"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/emittedLabel|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact ClassifierLabel artifact emitted by this output. Identity and label-set membership survive any reviewed mapping to a canonical category."
msgstr "此输出产生的确切 ClassifierLabel 制品。经审查映射到规范类别后，仍保留其标识及标签集成员关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetRevision|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "label-set revision"
msgstr "标签集版本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetRevision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The pinned label-set revision of this execution record. For zero-shot inference it identifies the exact candidate inventory as part of run identity."
msgstr "此执行记录固定的标签集版本。对零样本推理，它将确切候选清单标识为运行标识的一部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisTemplate|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "hypothesis template"
msgstr "假设模板"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/hypothesisTemplate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact classifier template source string, including placeholders, instantiated with each zero-shot candidate label. This xsd:string carries the supplied source expression rather than a localized utterance or machine identifier; changing it changes the execution context."
msgstr "确切的分类器模板源字符串（包括占位符），用每个零样本候选标签实例化。此 xsd:string 承载所提供的源表达式，而不是本地化话语或机器标识符；更改它会改变执行上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/memberOfLabelSet|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "member of label set"
msgstr "所属标签集"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/memberOfLabelSet|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Registers an exact label identity in its ClassifierLabelSet. Membership also applies to run-scoped candidates and does not imply a static registry or reviewed decision rule."
msgstr "将确切标签标识登记到其 ClassifierLabelSet。成员关系也适用于运行范围候选项，不蕴含静态注册表或经审查的决策规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelFramework|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "model framework"
msgstr "模型框架"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelFramework|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The execution framework captured in the run record, such as transformers or onnxruntime."
msgstr "运行记录捕获的执行框架，例如 transformers 或 onnxruntime。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelIdentifier|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "model identifier"
msgstr "模型标识"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelIdentifier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact model repository or artifact identifier pinned by the execution record, paired with modelRevision."
msgstr "执行记录固定的确切模型仓库或制品标识，与 modelRevision 配对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelRevision|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "model revision"
msgstr "模型版本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelRevision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact immutable model revision used for this execution. A mutable model name alone cannot satisfy the pinned revision requirement."
msgstr "此次执行使用的确切不可变模型版本。仅有可变模型名称不能满足固定版本要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelTask|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "model task"
msgstr "模型任务"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/producedBy|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "produced by"
msgstr "产生记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/producedBy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The single ModelInferenceRun record attributing this output. It points to an enduring record, not an Activity; it is not a wasGeneratedBy specialization."
msgstr "为此输出提供归属的唯一 ModelInferenceRun 记录。它指向持久记录，而非 Activity；不是 wasGeneratedBy 的特化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreCalibration|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "score calibration"
msgstr "分数校准"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreCalibration|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The identifier of the declared calibration profile of a score, required for calibrated-probability semantics. Calibration alone never turns probability into epistemic confidence."
msgstr "分数所声明校准配置的标识符，校准概率语义要求提供它。仅有校准绝不使概率变为认识置信度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreSemantics|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "score semantics"
msgstr "分数语义"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreSemantics|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The single declared interpretation of classifierScore from the open ScoreSemantics vocabulary. A bare uninterpreted number is incomplete evidence."
msgstr "从开放 ScoreSemantics 词表选择的 classifierScore 唯一声明解释。没有解释的裸数字是不完整证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/thresholdApplied|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "threshold applied"
msgstr "应用阈值"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/thresholdApplied|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The threshold actually applied to this output label. No universal threshold or requirement to threshold every classifier is implied."
msgstr "实际应用于此输出标签的阈值。不蕴含通用阈值，也不要求每个分类器都使用阈值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tokenizerRevision|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "tokenizer revision"
msgstr "分词器版本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tokenizerRevision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact tokenizer revision captured in this execution record; changing it may change scores independently of the model revision."
msgstr "此执行记录捕获的确切分词器版本；改变它可独立于模型版本而改变分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/usedInput|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "used input"
msgstr "使用的输入"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/usedInput|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An input recorded as consumed by the classifier execution. The subject is the execution record, not an Activity."
msgstr "记录为被分类器执行所使用的输入。主体是执行记录，而非 Activity。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetDecision|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "label set decision"
msgstr "标签集决策"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetDecision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The declared decision policy of a label set. Static registries used by the affect producer require one; run-scoped zero-shot candidates need not carry one. Where supplied it must agree with score semantics."
msgstr "标签集声明的决策策略。情感生产器使用的静态注册表必须提供；运行范围零样本候选集无需提供。如提供，必须与分数语义一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/impliesLabelSetDecision|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "implies label set decision"
msgstr "蕴含标签集决策"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/impliesLabelSetDecision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The compatibility commitment from score semantics to decision policy: softmax to argmax, sigmoid to independent thresholding. Logit, margin and per-hypothesis entailment carry none."
msgstr "从分数语义到决策策略的兼容承诺：softmax 对应最大值选择，sigmoid 对应独立阈值。logit 值、间隔和逐假设蕴含不带此承诺。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/runLabelSet|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "run label set"
msgstr "运行标签集"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/runLabelSet|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An explicit label set used by this execution record. When supplied, its outputs must emit labels belonging to that set. Existing records may capture membership through emitted labels and labelSetRevision instead. This edge implies no static decision rule."
msgstr "此执行记录使用的显式标签集。如提供，其输出标签必须属于此集合。现有记录可通过输出标签和 labelSetRevision 捕获成员关系。此边不蕴含静态决策规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreCalibratedProbability|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "calibrated probability"
msgstr "校准概率"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreCalibratedProbability|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A model probability under a declared calibration profile. Calibration alone authorizes neither epistemic confidence nor provenance-derived evidence strength."
msgstr "采用声明校准配置的模型概率。仅有校准不授权认知置信度或来源推导的证据强度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreLogit|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "logit"
msgstr "logit 值"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreLogit|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A raw pre-activation logit, potentially outside the unit interval and not a probability."
msgstr "激活前的原始logit 值，可能超出单位区间，并非概率。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreMargin|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "margin"
msgstr "间隔"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreMargin|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A decision margin, such as a signed classifier distance, not a probability."
msgstr "决策间隔，例如带符号的分类器距离，并非概率。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreSigmoid|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "sigmoid score"
msgstr "sigmoid 分数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreSigmoid|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A per-label sigmoid score in the unit interval. Independent-label interpretation is distinct from calibration, confidence and evidential warrant."
msgstr "单位区间内的逐标签 sigmoid 分数。独立标签解释有别于校准、置信度和证据论据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreSoftmax|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "softmax probability"
msgstr "softmax 概率"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreSoftmax|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A model probability normalized over the declared mutually exclusive label set. This simplex interpretation establishes neither calibration nor confidence."
msgstr "在声明的互斥标签集上归一化的模型概率。此单纯形解释不确立校准或置信度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreEntailment|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "entailment probability"
msgstr "蕴含概率"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreEntailment|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A per-hypothesis entailment-versus-contradiction model probability for a zero-shot candidate and template. It is not normalized across candidates and does not establish calibration or confidence."
msgstr "针对零样本候选及模板的逐假设蕴含对矛盾模型概率。它不在候选之间归一化，不确立校准或置信度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/decisionArgmax|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "argmax (single-label)"
msgstr "最大值选择（单标签）"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/decisionArgmax|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A single-label decision policy selecting an argmax over the label set. It does not discard other emitted scores or entail a canonical category claim."
msgstr "在标签集上选择最大值的单标签策略。不丢弃其他输出分数，也不蕴含规范类别主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/decisionIndependentThreshold|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "independent threshold (multi-label)"
msgstr "独立阈值（多标签）"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/decisionIndependentThreshold|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A per-label threshold policy admitting zero, one or several labels. Applied thresholds remain explicit output provenance."
msgstr "逐标签阈值策略，允许零个、一个或多个标签。应用的阈值仍作为显式输出来源信息保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RegisteredClassifierLabelSet|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Registered Classifier Label Set"
msgstr "已注册分类器标签集"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RegisteredClassifierLabelSet|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A static classifier registry admitted with a reviewed decision rule, specializing ClassifierLabelSet. The required labelSetDecision applies to this class only, never to every run-scoped candidate set."
msgstr "具有经审查决策规则的获准静态分类器注册表，特化自 ClassifierLabelSet。必需的 labelSetDecision 仅适用于此类，绝不适用于所有运行范围候选集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ZeroShotTemplatePresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Zero-shot template-present constraint"
msgstr "零样本模板存在约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClassifierRunLabelMembershipConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Classifier run label-membership constraint"
msgstr "分类器运行标签成员约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClassifierRunLabelMembershipConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "If an execution record explicitly declares runLabelSet, every label emitted by an output attributed to that record must belong to that set."
msgstr "如执行记录显式声明 runLabelSet，归属于该记录的输出所产生的每个标签都必须属于该集合。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/producedByFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:producedBy is functional: a classifier output is attributed to exactly one ModelInferenceRun execution record, so it cannot name two producing records. The record is distinct from an execution Activity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:producedBy 是函数性属性：分类器输出归属于恰好一个 ModelInferenceRun 执行记录，因而不能指定两个产生记录。记录与执行 Activity 保持区分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelTask|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The model task identifier captured in the execution record, such as text-classification or zero-shot-classification. Required hypothesis provenance follows declared entailment score semantics, not the spelling of this task identifier."
msgstr "执行记录中捕获的模型任务标识符，例如 text-classification 或 zero-shot-classification。所需的假设溯源依据已声明的蕴含分数语义，而不是此任务标识符的拼写。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ZeroShotTemplatePresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An execution record named by an output declaring scoreEntailment must preserve its exact hypothesisTemplate."
msgstr "声明 scoreEntailment 的输出所指定的执行记录必须保留其确切 hypothesisTemplate。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ModelInferenceRunIdentifierPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ModelInferenceRun identifier-present constraint"
msgstr "ModelInferenceRun 标识存在约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ModelInferenceRunIdentifierPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:ModelInferenceRun declares a gmeow:modelIdentifier."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：gmeow:ModelInferenceRun 声明 gmeow:modelIdentifier。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ModelInferenceRunRevisionPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ModelInferenceRun revision-present constraint"
msgstr "ModelInferenceRun 版本存在约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ModelInferenceRunRevisionPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:ModelInferenceRun declares a pinned gmeow:modelRevision."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：gmeow:ModelInferenceRun 声明固定的 gmeow:modelRevision。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputProducedByPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ClassifierOutput produced-by constraint"
msgstr "ClassifierOutput 产生记录约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputProducedByPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:ClassifierOutput is gmeow:producedBy a run."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：gmeow:ClassifierOutput 通过 gmeow:producedBy 关联运行记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputTargetPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ClassifierOutput target-present constraint"
msgstr "ClassifierOutput 目标存在约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputTargetPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:ClassifierOutput names a gmeow:classifiedTarget."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：gmeow:ClassifierOutput 指定 gmeow:classifiedTarget。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputLabelPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ClassifierOutput label-present constraint"
msgstr "ClassifierOutput 标签存在约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputLabelPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:ClassifierOutput carries a gmeow:emittedLabel."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：gmeow:ClassifierOutput 带有 gmeow:emittedLabel。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputScorePresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ClassifierOutput score-present constraint"
msgstr "ClassifierOutput 分数存在约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputScorePresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:ClassifierOutput carries a gmeow:classifierScore."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：gmeow:ClassifierOutput 带有 gmeow:classifierScore。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputSemanticsPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ClassifierOutput score-semantics constraint"
msgstr "ClassifierOutput 分数语义约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputSemanticsPresentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:ClassifierOutput declares a gmeow:scoreSemantics."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：gmeow:ClassifierOutput 声明 gmeow:scoreSemantics。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierLabelRegisteredConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Classifier label membership constraint"
msgstr "分类器标签成员约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierLabelRegisteredConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:ClassifierLabel is a gmeow:memberOfLabelSet of a label set."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：gmeow:ClassifierLabel 通过 gmeow:memberOfLabelSet 属于标签集。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ModelInferenceRunRevisionUniqueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ModelInferenceRun revision-unique constraint"
msgstr "ModelInferenceRun 版本唯一约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ModelInferenceRunRevisionUniqueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:ModelInferenceRun pins at most one gmeow:modelRevision."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：gmeow:ModelInferenceRun 至多固定一个 gmeow:modelRevision。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputCalibrationConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ClassifierOutput calibration constraint"
msgstr "ClassifierOutput 校准约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectClassifierOutputCalibrationConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:ClassifierOutput whose gmeow:scoreSemantics is gmeow:scoreCalibratedProbability declares a gmeow:scoreCalibration."
msgstr "封闭世界完整性约束：gmeow:scoreSemantics 为 gmeow:scoreCalibratedProbability 的 gmeow:ClassifierOutput 声明 gmeow:scoreCalibration。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectDecisionRuleConsistencyConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Classifier decision rule-consistency constraint"
msgstr "分类器决策规则一致性约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AffectDecisionRuleConsistencyConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world relational integrity constraint: a gmeow:ClassifierOutput's gmeow:scoreSemantics gmeow:impliesLabelSetDecision matches its emitted label's set gmeow:labelSetDecision."
msgstr "封闭世界关系完整性约束：gmeow:ClassifierOutput 的 gmeow:scoreSemantics 经由 gmeow:impliesLabelSetDecision 所蕴含的规则，与其输出标签所属集合的 gmeow:labelSetDecision 相符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunking|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Chunking"
msgstr "检索分块方案"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunking|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "One recorded segmentation of an exact source revision under an identified frozen contract. Source and contract artifacts retain their own content digests; the selected pins are distinct from any digest of this enclosing result record. Granularity and ordered member chunks describe this segmentation without assuming overlap or exhaustive coverage policies."
msgstr "在已标识的冻结契约下，对确切源版本记录的一次分块方案。源制品和契约制品各自保留内容摘要；所固定的摘要值有别于此外围结果记录的任何摘要。粒度及有序成员块描述本次分块，不预设重叠或穷尽覆盖策略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMember|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Chunking Member"
msgstr "分块方案成员"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMember|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The role of an actual contiguous Chunk selected into one Chunking. Its ordinal belongs to that chunking, and chunkOf identifies the exact carrier cut by its source-coordinate bounds. A different segmentation uses fresh chunk identities; this role does not turn every existing Chunk into a contract-bound member."
msgstr "在一个 Chunking 中选定的真实连续 Chunk 所承担的角色。其序号属于该分块方案，chunkOf 指定由源坐标边界切取的确切载体。另一分块方案使用新的块标识；此角色不会将所有现有 Chunk 变成受契约约束的成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExtent|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Block Extent"
msgstr "原子块范围"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExtent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A recorded whole-source extent of one ContentBlock in one exact source carrier. extentSource fixes the coordinate origin; spanStart and spanEnd retain the existing zero-based half-open Unicode-code-point semantics. These are not offsets local to the block or its division. This record supplies coordinates for atomic-boundary checks without redefining the block’s structural identity."
msgstr "一个 ContentBlock 在确切整体源载体中的范围记录。extentSource 固定坐标原点；spanStart 和 spanEnd 保持现有的零起点、半开区间 Unicode 码点语义。这些偏移不是块或所属分区的局部偏移。此记录为原子边界检查提供坐标，不重新定义块的结构标识。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSource|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunking source revision"
msgstr "分块源版本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact information artifact whose text this chunking segments, rather than a mutable work identity, location or enclosing import record."
msgstr "此分块方案所切取文本的确切信息制品，而非可变作品标识、位置或外围导入记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSourceDigest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunking source digest"
msgstr "分块源摘要"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSourceDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The selected contentDigest of the exact chunkingSource artifact, retained as the same complete RDF literal on this Chunking. Its lowercase hexadecimal spelling and grounded algorithm datatype both match the artifact declaration. It identifies the source bytes, not the enclosing result or its segmentation tuple. Other algorithm digests may coexist on the artifact."
msgstr "确切 chunkingSource 制品的选定 contentDigest，在此 Chunking 上保留为完全相同的 RDF 字面量。其小写十六进制写法和有依据的算法数据类型均须与制品声明相同。它标识源字节，而非外围结果或其分块元组。制品上可并存其他算法的摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingRulesArtifact|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunking rules artifact"
msgstr "分块规则制品"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingRulesArtifact|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The frozen rules artifact used for this segmentation and present in its creation context. It identifies the actual contract bytes, not prose describing a wrapper or a claim that the opaque contract has been executed or proved."
msgstr "本次分块使用且存在于创建上下文中的冻结规则制品。它标识实际契约字节，而非描述封装的文字，也不声称不透明契约已被执行或证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingRulesArtifact|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to identify the exact information artifact containing the rules applied to one recorded segmentation."
msgstr "用于标识包含某次已记录分块所采用规则的确切信息制品。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingRulesArtifact|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using an opaque configuration string, digest literal or reasoner contract in place of the actual rules artifact."
msgstr "避免用不透明配置字符串、摘要字面量或推理器契约替代实际规则制品。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingRulesArtifact|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the Chunking to its frozen InformationObject. Retain the artifact’s contentDigest and select its pin with chunkingContractDigest."
msgstr "将 Chunking 关联到其冻结的 InformationObject。保留制品的 contentDigest，并用 chunkingContractDigest 选定其固定摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingRulesArtifact|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Specializes contextIncluded for the rules present in the chunking’s creation context. This artifact relation is distinct from the literal chunkingContract on an EmbeddingFamily; neither relation entails execution or verification of the rules."
msgstr "将 contextIncluded 专门用于分块创建上下文中存在的规则。此制品关系不同于 EmbeddingFamily 上取字面量的 chunkingContract；两者均不蕴含规则已被执行或验证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingRulesArtifact|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:segmentation gmeow:chunkingRulesArtifact ex:rules ."
msgstr "ex:segmentation gmeow:chunkingRulesArtifact ex:rules ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingContractDigest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunking contract digest"
msgstr "分块契约摘要"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingContractDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The selected contentDigest of the exact rules artifact linked by chunkingRulesArtifact, retained as the same complete RDF literal on this Chunking. Its lowercase hexadecimal spelling and grounded algorithm datatype both match the artifact declaration. It identifies the contract bytes, not the enclosing result or its segmentation tuple. Other algorithm digests may coexist on the artifact."
msgstr "通过 chunkingRulesArtifact 关联的确切规则制品的选定 contentDigest，在此 Chunking 上保留为完全相同的 RDF 字面量。其小写十六进制写法和有依据的算法数据类型均须与制品声明相同。它标识契约字节，而非外围结果或其分块元组。制品上可并存其他算法的摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inChunking|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "in chunking"
msgstr "所属分块方案"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inChunking|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The one segmentation containing this selected chunk. Its source, contract and ordinal scope belong to that Chunking; membership is not a claim that all source text has been covered."
msgstr "包含此选定块的唯一分块方案。其源、契约和序号作用域属于该 Chunking；成员关系并不声称全部源文本均已覆盖。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/coversBlockExtent|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "covers block extent"
msgstr "覆盖原子块范围"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/coversBlockExtent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An atomic block occurrence wholly covered by this chunk, identified through its BlockExtent and extentOfBlock. The extent must share the chunk’s exact source origin. This relation neither substitutes local block offsets nor declares exhaustive source coverage."
msgstr "此块完整覆盖的原子块出现位置，通过其 BlockExtent 和 extentOfBlock 标识。范围必须与块共享确切源原点。此关系不以块局部偏移替代源坐标，也不声明穷尽源覆盖。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentOfBlock|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "extent of block"
msgstr "范围对应原子块"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentOfBlock|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The structural ContentBlock located by this whole-source extent record. The block keeps its existing division, structural index and segment kind."
msgstr "此整体源范围记录所定位的结构性 ContentBlock。原子块保留其现有分区、结构索引及段类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentSource|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "extent source origin"
msgstr "范围源原点"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact whole-source carrier whose Unicode-code-point origin these extent bounds use. A block-local rendering or a different revision is a different frame and cannot be compared silently with chunk bounds."
msgstr "这些范围边界所使用的 Unicode 码点原点对应的确切整体源载体。块局部呈现或其他版本属于不同坐标框架，不可悄然与块边界比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunk|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "chunkOf always names the actual carrier containing this chunk’s retrieved text. A generated summary is derived from its summarized division through wasDerivedFrom, not cut from that original division. Summary and Chunk may share a node only when that node is both a condensed account and a contiguous cut of its actual carrier. A digest describes the exact supplied chunk bytes; Unicode-code-point coordinates imply neither an encoding nor normalization. A canonical-document digest names that canonical artifact, not another serialization or a segmentation identifier."
msgstr "chunkOf 始终指定实际包含此块检索文本的载体。生成的摘要通过 wasDerivedFrom 派生自被概述分区，并非从原始分区切取。仅当一个节点既是浓缩叙述，又是实际载体的连续切片时，Summary 和 Chunk 才可共用该节点。摘要描述所提供的确切块字节；Unicode 码点坐标并不隐含编码或规范化。规范文档的摘要标识该规范制品，而非另一序列化或分块标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingSourceDigestWitnessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Chunking source digest witness constraint"
msgstr "分块源摘要见证约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingSourceDigestWitnessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The selected chunkingSourceDigest must occur as the same complete RDF literal on the exact chunkingSource artifact through contentDigest. Both lexical form and algorithm datatype must match; a digest of another artifact or the enclosing result does not satisfy this pin."
msgstr "选定 chunkingSourceDigest 必须作为完全相同的 RDF 字面量，经 contentDigest 出现在确切 chunkingSource 制品上。词法形式和算法数据类型均须相同；其他制品或外围结果的摘要不满足此固定值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingContractDigestWitnessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Chunking contract digest witness constraint"
msgstr "分块契约摘要见证约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingContractDigestWitnessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The selected chunkingContractDigest must occur as the same complete RDF literal on the exact rules artifact linked by chunkingRulesArtifact through contentDigest. Both lexical form and algorithm datatype must match; a digest of another artifact or the enclosing result does not satisfy this pin."
msgstr "选定 chunkingContractDigest 必须作为完全相同的 RDF 字面量，经 contentDigest 出现在通过 chunkingRulesArtifact 关联的确切规则制品上。词法形式和算法数据类型均须相同；其他制品或外围结果的摘要不满足此固定值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMemberSourceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Chunking member source constraint"
msgstr "分块成员源约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMemberSourceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A selected member’s actual chunkOf carrier equals the exact chunkingSource. Derivation from an original division does not make generated text a cut of that division."
msgstr "选定成员的实际 chunkOf 载体必须等于确切 chunkingSource。派生自原始分区并不意味着生成文本是该分区的切片。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingOrdinalUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Chunking ordinal uniqueness constraint"
msgstr "分块序号唯一约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingOrdinalUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Two selected members of one Chunking with the same entryOrdinal are the same member. This scoped sequence law imposes neither global order nor consecutive, non-overlapping or exhaustive source coverage."
msgstr "同一 Chunking 中具有相同 entryOrdinal 的两个选定成员必须是同一成员。此局部序列定律不施加全局顺序、连续序号、不重叠覆盖或穷尽源覆盖。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoveredExtentOriginConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Covered block extent origin constraint"
msgstr "覆盖原子块范围原点约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoveredExtentOriginConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An explicitly covered BlockExtent uses the exact chunkingSource as its whole-source coordinate origin. Local block or division frames cannot silently stand in for it."
msgstr "显式覆盖的 BlockExtent 必须以确切 chunkingSource 为整体源坐标原点。块或分区的局部框架不可悄然替代此原点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingAtomicBlockBoundaryConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Chunking atomic block boundary constraint"
msgstr "分块原子块边界约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingAtomicBlockBoundaryConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Whenever a selected chunk intersects a represented atomic BlockExtent in the same exact source frame, it contains that whole extent and records coversBlockExtent. Omitting a coverage assertion does not hide a split boundary. The law does not certify that all source blocks have been represented."
msgstr "当选定块与同一确切源框架中已表示的原子 BlockExtent 相交时，必须包含该完整范围并记录 coversBlockExtent。省略覆盖断言不能隐藏切开的边界。此定律不证明所有源块均已表示。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoverageIntersectionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Chunking coverage intersection constraint"
msgstr "分块覆盖相交约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoverageIntersectionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An asserted covered extent must actually intersect the selected chunk in their shared whole-source frame. Boundary-touching and disjoint extents are not covered blocks."
msgstr "声明覆盖的范围必须在共享整体源框架中与选定块实际相交。仅边界接触或不相交的范围不是被覆盖块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecord|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Held Record"
msgstr "文本所含记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An occurrence of a machine record cut out of a particular source text and decomposed into facts. Surrounding words are retained verbatim, its original code-point span is recorded, and its content and other fields become facts; its own serialized text, whitespace, escapes and key order are not retained."
msgstr "从特定来源文本中截取并分解为事实的机器记录出现。周围文字按原样保留，记录原始码点范围，内容及其他字段成为事实；不保留其自身序列化文本、空白、转义和键顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The span refers to the original text before extraction, never the shortened retained text. These declarations neither parse a record nor certify a generic triple-term kind check."
msgstr "范围指向提取前的原始文本，而非保留的缩短文本。这些声明不解析记录，也不认证通用三元组项类型检查。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:text gmeow:textHeldRecord ex:held . ex:held a gmeow:HeldRecord ; gmeow:spanStart \"7\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:spanEnd \"20\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."
msgstr "ex:text gmeow:textHeldRecord ex:held . ex:held a gmeow:HeldRecord ; gmeow:spanStart \"7\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:spanEnd \"20\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/textHeldRecord|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "text held record"
msgstr "文本包含记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/textHeldRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates one text occurrence to a machine-record occurrence removed from among its words and decomposed into facts. The text carrier retains the surrounding words; each removed occurrence has its own original code-point span."
msgstr "将一次文本出现连接到从其文字间移除并分解为事实的机器记录出现。文本载体保留周围文字；每个被移除的出现均有自己的原始码点范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/textHeldRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Several held records may belong to one text occurrence. The link does not retain the removed serialization or establish parsing success."
msgstr "一次文本出现可包含多个记录。此链接不保留被移除的序列化，也不证明解析成功。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/textHeldRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:text gmeow:textHeldRecord ex:held ."
msgstr "ex:text gmeow:textHeldRecord ex:held ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/heldContentStatement|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "held content statement"
msgstr "所含内容语句"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/heldContentStatement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The distinguished RDF 1.2 triple term representing a held record's decomposed content. The same term is supplied through explicit rdf:reifies on the HeldRecord occurrence, preserving the existing statement-metadata production path."
msgstr "表示所含记录已分解内容的特定 RDF 1.2 三元组项。在 HeldRecord 出现上通过显式 rdf:reifies 提供同一项，保留现有语句元数据生产路径。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/heldContentStatement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The binding law checks identical graph-term joins to explicit reifier evidence. It does not add a generic triple-term validator, authenticate decomposition or assert a quoted statement."
msgstr "绑定规则通过相同图项连接检查显式重化证据。它不新增通用三元组项验证器，不认证分解，也不自动断言引用语句。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/heldContentStatement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:held gmeow:heldContentStatement <<( ex:item gmeow:description \"ready\"@en )>> ; rdf:reifies <<( ex:item gmeow:description \"ready\"@en )>> ."
msgstr "ex:held gmeow:heldContentStatement <<( ex:item gmeow:description \"就绪\"@zh )>> ; rdf:reifies <<( ex:item gmeow:description \"就绪\"@zh )>> ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Held record evidence constraint"
msgstr "所含记录证据约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every HeldRecord has a containing text occurrence and a distinguished content term shared with explicit rdf:reifies evidence on that same record."
msgstr "每个 HeldRecord 均具有一个包含它的文本出现，以及与同一记录上的显式 rdf:reifies 证据共享的特定内容项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Shared graph-term bindings preserve the explicit reifier path. They do not implement parsing or a generic triple-term kind test."
msgstr "相同图项绑定保留显式重化路径。它们不实现解析，也不实现通用三元组项类型检查。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:HeldRecordEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:HeldRecord ."
msgstr "gmeow:HeldRecordEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:HeldRecord ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordReifierBindingConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Held record reifier binding constraint"
msgstr "所含记录重化绑定约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordReifierBindingConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every heldContentStatement term and every explicit rdf:reifies term on a HeldRecord agree through identical graph-term joins."
msgstr "HeldRecord 上的每个 heldContentStatement 项与每个显式 rdf:reifies 项均通过相同图项连接保持一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordReifierBindingConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The two source roles retain the same RDF term without relying on a subproperty inference before statement-metadata extraction."
msgstr "两个来源角色保留同一 RDF 项，不依赖语句元数据提取前的子属性推理。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordReifierBindingConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:HeldRecordReifierBindingConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:heldContentStatement ."
msgstr "gmeow:HeldRecordReifierBindingConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:heldContentStatement ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordParentUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Held record parent uniqueness constraint"
msgstr "所含记录父文本唯一性约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordParentUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A HeldRecord occurrence belongs to only one containing text occurrence. Several held records may belong to the same text."
msgstr "一个 HeldRecord 出现仅属于一个包含它的文本出现。同一文本可包含多个记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordParentUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Occurrence identity is source-local; shared content does not merge independent occurrences."
msgstr "出现身份局限于来源；共享内容不合并独立出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordParentUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:HeldRecordParentUniquenessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:textHeldRecord ."
msgstr "gmeow:HeldRecordParentUniquenessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:textHeldRecord ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordSpanOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Held record span order constraint"
msgstr "所含记录范围顺序约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordSpanOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original half-open code-point span of a HeldRecord has a start strictly before its end."
msgstr "HeldRecord 的原始半开码点范围起点严格小于终点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordSpanOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "No upper bound is compared with shortened retained text. Original source length is not reconstructed or invented."
msgstr "不与保留的缩短文本比较上界。不重建或虚构原始来源长度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldRecordSpanOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:HeldRecordSpanOrderConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:HeldRecord ."
msgstr "gmeow:HeldRecordSpanOrderConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:HeldRecord ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldContentCountConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Held content count constraint"
msgstr "所含内容数量约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldContentCountConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A HeldRecord supplies exactly one distinct RDF term through heldContentStatement. The separate evidence law requires presence when the aggregate has no rows."
msgstr "HeldRecord 通过 heldContentStatement 提供恰好一个不同的 RDF 项。当聚合没有行时，独立证据规则要求其存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldContentCountConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "COUNT DISTINCT uses graph-term identity, keeping alternate literal spellings inside triple terms distinct; it does not compare decoded values."
msgstr "COUNT DISTINCT 使用图项身份，区分三元组项内部不同的字面量拼写；它不比较解码后的值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/HeldContentCountConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:HeldContentCountConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:heldContentStatement ."
msgstr "gmeow:HeldContentCountConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:heldContentStatement ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunking|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain one segmentation of a named source revision under a frozen rules artifact."
msgstr "用于保留在冻结规则制品下对指定源版本进行的一次分块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunking|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a result record as its source, its rules artifact or proof of complete source coverage."
msgstr "避免把结果记录当作其源、规则制品或源已被完全覆盖的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunking|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Name chunkingSource and chunkingRulesArtifact, retain their selected digest pins and hasGranularity, and link selected chunks through inChunking."
msgstr "指定 chunkingSource 和 chunkingRulesArtifact，保留选定摘要固定值及 hasGranularity，并通过 inChunking 关联选定块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunking|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This InformationObject records a segmentation. Member ordinals and represented block extents do not impose overlap, consecutive ordering or exhaustive coverage policies."
msgstr "此 InformationObject 记录一次分块。成员序号和已表示的块范围不规定重叠、连续排序或穷尽覆盖策略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunking|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:segmentation a gmeow:Chunking ; gmeow:chunkingSource ex:revision ; gmeow:chunkingRulesArtifact ex:rules ."
msgstr "ex:segmentation a gmeow:Chunking ; gmeow:chunkingSource ex:revision ; gmeow:chunkingRulesArtifact ex:rules ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMember|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an actual contiguous Chunk selected into one recorded chunking."
msgstr "用于在一次已记录分块中选定的真实连续 Chunk。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMember|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid applying this role to every Chunk or reusing a chunk identity for a different segmentation."
msgstr "避免将此角色用于每个 Chunk，或在另一分块中重用同一块身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMember|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link inChunking to the selected result, retain entryOrdinal, chunkOf and span bounds, and identify covered atomic occurrences through coversBlockExtent."
msgstr "用 inChunking 关联选定结果，保留 entryOrdinal、chunkOf 和跨度边界，并通过 coversBlockExtent 标识所覆盖的原子块出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMember|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The ordinal is scoped to the selected chunking. chunkOf names the carrier containing the retrieved text; derivation from another artifact does not change that carrier."
msgstr "序号的作用域限于选定分块。chunkOf 指定包含检索文本的载体；从其他制品派生并不改变该载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMember|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:member a gmeow:ChunkingMember ; gmeow:inChunking ex:segmentation ; gmeow:chunkOf ex:revision ."
msgstr "ex:member a gmeow:ChunkingMember ; gmeow:inChunking ex:segmentation ; gmeow:chunkOf ex:revision ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExtent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to locate a structural ContentBlock in an exact whole-source coordinate frame."
msgstr "用于在确切的整体源坐标系中定位结构性 ContentBlock。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExtent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting block-local offsets or treating the extent record as the structural block itself."
msgstr "避免替换为块内局部偏移，或把范围记录当作结构块本身。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExtent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Name extentOfBlock and extentSource, then retain spanStart and spanEnd in that carrier’s zero-based, half-open Unicode-code-point frame."
msgstr "指定 extentOfBlock 和 extentSource，再按该载体零起点、半开区间的 Unicode 码点坐标保留 spanStart 与 spanEnd。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExtent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This InformationObject supplies represented coordinates for boundary laws. Its presence does not certify that every block in the source has an extent record."
msgstr "此 InformationObject 为边界法则提供已表示的坐标。存在此记录并不证明源中的每个块都有范围记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExtent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:extent a gmeow:BlockExtent ; gmeow:extentOfBlock ex:paragraph ; gmeow:extentSource ex:revision ."
msgstr "ex:extent a gmeow:BlockExtent ; gmeow:extentOfBlock ex:paragraph ; gmeow:extentSource ex:revision ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to identify the exact information artifact segmented by a Chunking."
msgstr "用于标识 Chunking 所分割的确切信息制品。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid pointing at a mutable work, a location or an import wrapper in place of the actual source revision."
msgstr "避免用可变作品、位置或导入包装记录替代实际源版本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the result to its source InformationObject and retain the selected source digest separately with chunkingSourceDigest."
msgstr "将结果关联到其源 InformationObject，并用 chunkingSourceDigest 单独保留选定源摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The source artifact supplies the member carrier and whole-source coordinate origin. Naming it neither reads its bytes nor computes its digest."
msgstr "源制品提供成员载体和整体源坐标原点。指定它并不会读取字节或计算摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:segmentation gmeow:chunkingSource ex:revision ."
msgstr "ex:segmentation gmeow:chunkingSource ex:revision ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inChunking|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to select the one segmentation whose member role this chunk bears."
msgstr "用于选择此块承担成员角色的唯一分块方案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inChunking|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid interpreting membership as global chunk order, source completeness or membership in every segmentation of that source."
msgstr "避免将成员关系解释为全局块顺序、源完整性或属于该源的每个分块方案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inChunking|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link each ChunkingMember to its Chunking and interpret its entryOrdinal within that result."
msgstr "将每个 ChunkingMember 关联到其 Chunking，并在该结果内解释 entryOrdinal。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inChunking|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This relation scopes the member’s source, rules and ordinal obligations. It does not require consecutive ordinals or prohibit overlap between distinct members."
msgstr "此关系限定成员的源、规则和序号义务。它不要求序号连续，也不禁止不同成员重叠。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/inChunking|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:member gmeow:inChunking ex:segmentation ."
msgstr "ex:member gmeow:inChunking ex:segmentation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/coversBlockExtent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record the atomic block occurrences wholly included in a selected chunk."
msgstr "用于记录完全包含于选定块中的原子块出现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/coversBlockExtent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming coverage for an extent that is disjoint, merely touches a boundary or uses another source origin."
msgstr "避免对不相交、仅接触边界或采用其他源原点的范围声称覆盖。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/coversBlockExtent|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the ChunkingMember to each covered BlockExtent, retaining the extent’s structural block, exact carrier and whole-source bounds."
msgstr "将 ChunkingMember 关联到每个已覆盖 BlockExtent，保留其结构块、确切载体及整体源边界。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/coversBlockExtent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The boundary law also examines represented extents without this relation. Omitting the relation cannot hide an intersecting split; asserted coverage does not certify exhaustive source coverage."
msgstr "边界法则也检查缺少此关系的已表示范围。省略关系不能掩盖相交切分；已断言覆盖不证明源已被穷尽覆盖。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/coversBlockExtent|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:member gmeow:coversBlockExtent ex:extent ."
msgstr "ex:member gmeow:coversBlockExtent ex:extent ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentOfBlock|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to identify the structural ContentBlock located by a BlockExtent."
msgstr "用于标识由 BlockExtent 定位的结构性 ContentBlock。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentOfBlock|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing the block’s division, structural index or segment kind with this coordinate record."
msgstr "避免用此坐标记录替代块所属分区、结构索引或片段种类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentOfBlock|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the extent to the existing ContentBlock and keep its whole-source carrier in extentSource."
msgstr "将范围关联到已有 ContentBlock，并用 extentSource 保留其整体源载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentOfBlock|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The relation identifies the block occurrence described by the extent. Coordinates remain on the extent; the block retains its documents-slice structure."
msgstr "此关系标识范围所描述的块出现。坐标仍属于范围；块保留 documents 切片中的结构。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentOfBlock|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:extent gmeow:extentOfBlock ex:paragraph ."
msgstr "ex:extent gmeow:extentOfBlock ex:paragraph ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to declare the exact whole-source carrier supplying an extent’s coordinate origin."
msgstr "用于声明提供范围坐标原点的确切整体源载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid silently comparing bounds from different revisions or block-local and whole-source frames."
msgstr "避免默默比较不同版本的边界，或将块内局部坐标与整体源坐标相比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentSource|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the BlockExtent to the actual source InformationObject and express both span bounds in that carrier’s Unicode-code-point coordinates."
msgstr "将 BlockExtent 关联到实际源 InformationObject，并以该载体的 Unicode 码点坐标表示两个跨度边界。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Covered extents use the selected chunkingSource as origin. This frame relation performs no coordinate conversion or validation against source bytes."
msgstr "已覆盖范围以选定 chunkingSource 为原点。此坐标系关系不转换坐标，也不对源字节进行验证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/extentSource|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:extent gmeow:extentSource ex:revision ."
msgstr "ex:extent gmeow:extentSource ex:revision ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingSourceDigestWitnessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to require the selected source pin to be witnessed on the named source artifact."
msgstr "用于要求选定源固定摘要在指定源制品上具有见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingSourceDigestWitnessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting a matching digest on another artifact or treating a recorded witness as byte authentication."
msgstr "避免接受其他制品上的匹配摘要，或将已记录见证当作字节认证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingSourceDigestWitnessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "For each Chunking with chunkingSource and chunkingSourceDigest, retain the corresponding contentDigest on that exact source."
msgstr "对于带有 chunkingSource 和 chunkingSourceDigest 的每个 Chunking，在该确切源上保留对应 contentDigest。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingSourceDigestWitnessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The formula checks the recorded source/digest relation. It neither computes a hash nor selects an algorithm or a default source."
msgstr "公式检查已记录的源与摘要关系。它不计算散列，也不选择算法或默认源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingSourceDigestWitnessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ChunkingSourceDigestWitnessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:chunkingSourceDigest ."
msgstr "gmeow:ChunkingSourceDigestWitnessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:chunkingSourceDigest ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingContractDigestWitnessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to require a digest witness on the actual rules artifact selected by the chunking."
msgstr "用于要求分块所选实际规则制品具有摘要见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingContractDigestWitnessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting the result record’s digest or treating matching recorded pins as proof that rules were executed."
msgstr "避免替换为结果记录的摘要，或将已记录固定值匹配视为规则已执行的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingContractDigestWitnessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Follow chunkingRulesArtifact and retain the selected chunkingContractDigest among that artifact’s own contentDigest values."
msgstr "沿 chunkingRulesArtifact 获取制品，并在该制品自身的 contentDigest 值中保留选定 chunkingContractDigest。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingContractDigestWitnessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The formula concerns the selected rules artifact and its recorded digest. It does not execute the rules, authenticate bytes or equate an EmbeddingFamily configuration literal with an artifact."
msgstr "公式涉及选定规则制品及其已记录摘要。它不执行规则、不认证字节，也不将 EmbeddingFamily 配置字面量等同于制品。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingContractDigestWitnessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ChunkingContractDigestWitnessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:chunkingRulesArtifact ."
msgstr "gmeow:ChunkingContractDigestWitnessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:chunkingRulesArtifact ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMemberSourceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check that a selected chunk’s actual text carrier agrees with the chunking’s source."
msgstr "用于检查选定块的实际文本载体是否与分块的源一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMemberSourceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using wasDerivedFrom to claim that generated summary text is cut from its original division."
msgstr "避免用 wasDerivedFrom 声称生成的摘要文本是从原始分区切取的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMemberSourceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Follow inChunking to chunkingSource and compare that carrier with the member’s recorded chunkOf."
msgstr "沿 inChunking 找到 chunkingSource，并将该载体与成员已记录的 chunkOf 比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMemberSourceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The formula compares the named carriers. It does not inspect the retrieved text or infer a carrier from derivation history."
msgstr "公式比较指定载体。它不检查检索文本，也不从派生历史推断载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingMemberSourceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ChunkingMemberSourceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:chunkOf ."
msgstr "gmeow:ChunkingMemberSourceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:chunkOf ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingOrdinalUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to require one member identity at each recorded ordinal within a chunking."
msgstr "用于要求一次分块中每个已记录序号只对应一个成员身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingOrdinalUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reading ordinal uniqueness as consecutive numbering, source order or non-overlapping coverage."
msgstr "避免将序号唯一性理解为连续编号、源顺序或不重叠覆盖。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingOrdinalUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Compare members sharing inChunking and entryOrdinal; those bindings must identify the same member."
msgstr "比较共享 inChunking 和 entryOrdinal 的成员；这些绑定必须标识同一成员。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingOrdinalUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The comparison is local to one result. Gaps in ordinals and overlap between different members are not forbidden by this law."
msgstr "比较仅限于一个结果。此法则不禁止序号间隙，也不禁止不同成员重叠。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingOrdinalUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ChunkingOrdinalUniquenessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:entryOrdinal ."
msgstr "gmeow:ChunkingOrdinalUniquenessConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:entryOrdinal ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoveredExtentOriginConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check the source origin of every extent explicitly claimed as covered by a member."
msgstr "用于检查成员明确声称已覆盖的每个范围的源原点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoveredExtentOriginConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid silently substituting a block-local frame, a division-local frame or another revision."
msgstr "避免默默替换为块内或分区内局部坐标系，或其他版本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoveredExtentOriginConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Follow coversBlockExtent to extentSource and compare it with chunkingSource selected through inChunking."
msgstr "沿 coversBlockExtent 找到 extentSource，并将其与通过 inChunking 选定的 chunkingSource 比较。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoveredExtentOriginConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The formula compares recorded origins for claimed coverage. It performs no coordinate transformation and does not enumerate missing extent records."
msgstr "公式比较已声称覆盖的记录原点。它不转换坐标，也不枚举缺失的范围记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoveredExtentOriginConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ChunkingCoveredExtentOriginConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:extentSource ."
msgstr "gmeow:ChunkingCoveredExtentOriginConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:extentSource ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingAtomicBlockBoundaryConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to require whole-block containment whenever a selected chunk intersects a represented extent in the same source frame."
msgstr "用于在选定块与同源坐标系中的已表示范围相交时要求完整包含该块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingAtomicBlockBoundaryConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid hiding a represented split by omitting coversBlockExtent or treating the law as a certificate of complete block inventory."
msgstr "避免省略 coversBlockExtent 来掩盖已表示的切分，或将法则当作块清单完整性的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingAtomicBlockBoundaryConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "For every represented same-source extent intersecting the member, retain enclosing chunk bounds and the corresponding coversBlockExtent relation."
msgstr "对与成员相交的每个已表示同源范围，保留包围它的块边界及相应 coversBlockExtent 关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingAtomicBlockBoundaryConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The guard uses strict intersection comparisons; the consequent requires containment and explicit coverage. It neither discovers unrepresented blocks nor calculates coordinates from source bytes."
msgstr "前提采用严格相交比较；结论要求包含和显式覆盖。它不发现尚未表示的块，也不从源字节计算坐标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingAtomicBlockBoundaryConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ChunkingAtomicBlockBoundaryConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:BlockExtent ."
msgstr "gmeow:ChunkingAtomicBlockBoundaryConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:BlockExtent ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoverageIntersectionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to require actual intersection for every asserted covered extent in the shared source frame."
msgstr "用于要求共享源坐标系中每个已断言覆盖范围实际相交。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoverageIntersectionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid calling a disjoint extent or one that merely touches an exclusive boundary a covered block."
msgstr "避免将不相交或仅接触排除边界的范围称为已覆盖块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoverageIntersectionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "For each coversBlockExtent relation, compare member and extent bounds using start < blockEnd and blockStart < end."
msgstr "对每条 coversBlockExtent 关系，使用 start < blockEnd 和 blockStart < end 比较成员与范围的边界。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoverageIntersectionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This law checks strict intersection of claimed coverage. Whole-block containment is a separate boundary obligation; neither obligation proves exhaustive source coverage."
msgstr "此法则检查所声称覆盖的严格相交性。完整包含块属于独立的边界义务；两种义务均不证明源已被穷尽覆盖。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkingCoverageIntersectionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ChunkingCoverageIntersectionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:coversBlockExtent ."
msgstr "gmeow:ChunkingCoverageIntersectionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:coversBlockExtent ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelVersionTag|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "model version tag"
msgstr "模型版本标记"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelVersionTag|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The provider's wire-level version identifier for the described snapshot. Use DOI/version-identity machinery for stable citation-grade identity."
msgstr "提供者在传输协议中为所述快照指定的版本标识符。稳定的引用级身份使用 DOI 和版本身份机制。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelVersionTag|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:opusCard gmeow:modelVersionTag \"claude-opus-4-8[1m]\" ."
msgstr "ex:opusCard gmeow:modelVersionTag \"claude-opus-4-8[1m]\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelVersionTag|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using it for citation-grade version identity (that rides the DOI/version-identity machinery) and avoid treating two different version tags as the same model snapshot."
msgstr "避免将其用作引用级版本身份，该身份由 DOI 和版本身份机制承载；也不要将两个不同的版本标记视为同一模型快照。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelVersionTag|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the provider's supplied xsd:string or xsd:token version literal on ModelCard; pair with the DOI machinery when a stable, citable version identity is required."
msgstr "在 ModelCard 上保留提供者给出的 xsd:string 或 xsd:token 版本字面量；需要稳定且可引用的版本身份时，结合 DOI 机制使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelVersionTag|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record the provider's wire-level version string for the snapshot a gmeow:ModelCard describes — the exact identifier a gmeow:ModelInvocation can be matched against."
msgstr "用于记录 gmeow:ModelCard 所描述快照的提供者协议版本字符串，即可与 gmeow:ModelInvocation 匹配的确切标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelVersionTag|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Preserve the supplied lexical form and datatype: verbatim xsd:string and explicitly supplied xsd:token are admitted. Do not normalize whitespace, retype a string or infer token typing. These declarations do not install a token lexical checker or certify identity from equal spelling."
msgstr "保留提供的词法形式和数据类型：接受原样的 xsd:string 及显式提供的 xsd:token。不得归一化空白、重设字符串类型或推断 token 类型。这些声明不安装 token 词法检查器，也不以拼写相同证明身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a source pins the exact label-set revision used by an inference run."
msgstr "来源固定某次推理运行所用标签集的确切修订时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a revision tag as the label inventory itself or inventing a revision when the source supplied none."
msgstr "避免将修订标记当作标签清单本身，也不要凭空补出来源未提供的修订。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied revision literal on ModelInferenceRun with its candidate inventory and exact hypothesisTemplate when applicable."
msgstr "在 ModelInferenceRun 上保留所提供的修订字面量、候选清单，以及适用时的确切 hypothesisTemplate。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetRevision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:run gmeow:labelSetRevision \"candidate-inventory-v1\"^^xsd:token ."
msgstr "ex:run gmeow:labelSetRevision \"candidate-inventory-v1\"^^xsd:token ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/labelSetRevision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Preserve the supplied lexical form and datatype: verbatim xsd:string and explicitly supplied xsd:token are admitted. Do not normalize whitespace, retype a string or infer token typing. These declarations do not install a token lexical checker or certify identity from equal spelling."
msgstr "保留提供的词法形式和数据类型：接受原样的 xsd:string 及显式提供的 xsd:token。不得归一化空白、重设字符串类型或推断 token 类型。这些声明不安装 token 词法检查器，也不以拼写相同证明身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelFramework|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the execution framework identifier reported for a model inference run."
msgstr "用于保留模型推理运行所报告的执行框架标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelFramework|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a framework name as a model identity, revision or proof that execution occurred."
msgstr "避免将框架名称当作模型身份、修订或执行已经发生的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelFramework|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied framework literal on ModelInferenceRun; retain modelIdentifier and modelRevision as separate execution coordinates."
msgstr "在 ModelInferenceRun 上保留所提供的框架字面量；将 modelIdentifier 和 modelRevision 作为独立的执行坐标保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelFramework|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:run gmeow:modelFramework \"onnxruntime\"^^xsd:token ."
msgstr "ex:run gmeow:modelFramework \"onnxruntime\"^^xsd:token ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelFramework|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Preserve the supplied lexical form and datatype: verbatim xsd:string and explicitly supplied xsd:token are admitted. Do not normalize whitespace, retype a string or infer token typing. These declarations do not install a token lexical checker or certify identity from equal spelling."
msgstr "保留提供的词法形式和数据类型：接受原样的 xsd:string 及显式提供的 xsd:token。不得归一化空白、重设字符串类型或推断 token 类型。这些声明不安装 token 词法检查器，也不以拼写相同证明身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelIdentifier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to identify the model repository or artifact pinned by an inference record."
msgstr "用于标识推理记录所固定的模型仓库或制品。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelIdentifier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing the pinned model identity with a mutable display name or merging identifiers from unrelated producer namespaces."
msgstr "避免用可变的显示名称替换已固定的模型身份，也不要合并来自不同生产者命名空间的标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelIdentifier|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied identifier literal and its producer attribution on ModelInferenceRun, paired with the exact modelRevision."
msgstr "在 ModelInferenceRun 上保留所提供的标识符字面量及其生产者归属，并与确切的 modelRevision 配对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelIdentifier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:run gmeow:modelIdentifier \"example/genre-nli\"^^xsd:token ."
msgstr "ex:run gmeow:modelIdentifier \"example/genre-nli\"^^xsd:token ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelIdentifier|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Preserve the supplied lexical form and datatype: verbatim xsd:string and explicitly supplied xsd:token are admitted. Do not normalize whitespace, retype a string or infer token typing. These declarations do not install a token lexical checker or certify identity from equal spelling."
msgstr "保留提供的词法形式和数据类型：接受原样的 xsd:string 及显式提供的 xsd:token。不得归一化空白、重设字符串类型或推断 token 类型。这些声明不安装 token 词法检查器，也不以拼写相同证明身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a source records the immutable model revision for an inference run."
msgstr "来源记录某次推理运行所用模型的不可变修订时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a revision from a mutable model name or treating equal revision spelling across different repositories as identity."
msgstr "避免根据可变模型名称虚构修订，也不要将不同仓库中拼写相同的修订视为身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied revision literal with modelIdentifier on the same ModelInferenceRun; retain evidence of the revision pin separately."
msgstr "在同一 ModelInferenceRun 上将所提供的修订字面量与 modelIdentifier 一同保留；另行保留固定该修订的证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelRevision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:run gmeow:modelRevision \"5f4d3c2b1a0987654321fedcba9876543210abcd\"^^xsd:token ."
msgstr "ex:run gmeow:modelRevision \"5f4d3c2b1a0987654321fedcba9876543210abcd\"^^xsd:token ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelRevision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Preserve the supplied lexical form and datatype: verbatim xsd:string and explicitly supplied xsd:token are admitted. Do not normalize whitespace, retype a string or infer token typing. These declarations do not install a token lexical checker or certify identity from equal spelling."
msgstr "保留提供的词法形式和数据类型：接受原样的 xsd:string 及显式提供的 xsd:token。不得归一化空白、重设字符串类型或推断 token 类型。这些声明不安装 token 词法检查器，也不以拼写相同证明身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelTask|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the task identifier reported by an inference execution record."
msgstr "用于保留推理执行记录所报告的任务标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelTask|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving score semantics or required hypothesis provenance from the spelling of the task identifier."
msgstr "避免根据任务标识符的拼写推导分数语义或所需的假设溯源信息。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelTask|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied task literal on ModelInferenceRun; declare scoreSemantics on each output independently."
msgstr "在 ModelInferenceRun 上保留所提供的任务字面量；在每个输出上独立声明 scoreSemantics。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelTask|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:run gmeow:modelTask \"zero-shot-classification\"^^xsd:token ."
msgstr "ex:run gmeow:modelTask \"zero-shot-classification\"^^xsd:token ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelTask|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Preserve the supplied lexical form and datatype: verbatim xsd:string and explicitly supplied xsd:token are admitted. Do not normalize whitespace, retype a string or infer token typing. These declarations do not install a token lexical checker or certify identity from equal spelling."
msgstr "保留提供的词法形式和数据类型：接受原样的 xsd:string 及显式提供的 xsd:token。不得归一化空白、重设字符串类型或推断 token 类型。这些声明不安装 token 词法检查器，也不以拼写相同证明身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreCalibration|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to identify the calibration profile declared for a classifier score."
msgstr "用于标识为某个分类器分数声明的校准配置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreCalibration|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring calibration from a number in the unit interval or treating a calibration profile as epistemic confidence."
msgstr "避免从单位区间内的数值推断已经校准，也不要将校准配置当作认识置信度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreCalibration|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied calibration-profile literal on ClassifierOutput beside its classifierScore and declared scoreSemantics."
msgstr "在 ClassifierOutput 上将所提供的校准配置字面量与 classifierScore 及已声明的 scoreSemantics 一同保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreCalibration|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:output gmeow:scoreCalibration \"temperature-scaling-v1\"^^xsd:token ."
msgstr "ex:output gmeow:scoreCalibration \"temperature-scaling-v1\"^^xsd:token ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreCalibration|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Preserve the supplied lexical form and datatype: verbatim xsd:string and explicitly supplied xsd:token are admitted. Do not normalize whitespace, retype a string or infer token typing. These declarations do not install a token lexical checker or certify identity from equal spelling."
msgstr "保留提供的词法形式和数据类型：接受原样的 xsd:string 及显式提供的 xsd:token。不得归一化空白、重设字符串类型或推断 token 类型。这些声明不安装 token 词法检查器，也不以拼写相同证明身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tokenizerRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source records the tokenizer revision used by an inference run."
msgstr "来源记录某次推理运行所用分词器的修订时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tokenizerRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid assuming a tokenizer revision from the model revision or discarding it because the model weights are unchanged."
msgstr "避免根据模型修订假定分词器修订，也不要因模型权重未变而丢弃分词器修订。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tokenizerRevision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied tokenizer revision literal on ModelInferenceRun alongside the independent model revision."
msgstr "在 ModelInferenceRun 上保留所提供的分词器修订字面量，并同时保留独立的模型修订。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tokenizerRevision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:run gmeow:tokenizerRevision \"tokenizer-v3\"^^xsd:token ."
msgstr "ex:run gmeow:tokenizerRevision \"tokenizer-v3\"^^xsd:token ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/tokenizerRevision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Preserve the supplied lexical form and datatype: verbatim xsd:string and explicitly supplied xsd:token are admitted. Do not normalize whitespace, retype a string or infer token typing. These declarations do not install a token lexical checker or certify identity from equal spelling."
msgstr "保留提供的词法形式和数据类型：接受原样的 xsd:string 及显式提供的 xsd:token。不得归一化空白、重设字符串类型或推断 token 类型。这些声明不安装 token 词法检查器，也不以拼写相同证明身份相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunk|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A contiguous segment of a source information object, produced for retrieval and located by chunkOf, spanStart and spanEnd. Its contentDigest literals identify its exact supplied bytes using the grounded BLAKE3-256, SHA-256 or MD5 datatype; the algorithm remains part of literal identity. The segment is what a retriever returns, a model reads and an evidence span pins into."
msgstr "源信息对象中供检索使用的连续片段，由 chunkOf、spanStart 和 spanEnd 定位。其 contentDigest 字面量通过有依据的 BLAKE3-256、SHA-256 或 MD5 数据类型标识所提供的确切字节；算法属于字面量标识的一部分。该片段是检索器返回、模型读取、证据范围锚定的内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunk|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Type the segment Chunk, retain chunkOf and its half-open Unicode-code-point spanStart and spanEnd, and record supplied contentDigest literals with their algorithm datatype and lowercase hexadecimal spelling. Keep all supplied algorithms, with at most one distinct value per algorithm. Record the actual input artifact if canonical bytes are hashed; a typed digest does not verify those bytes."
msgstr "将片段声明为 Chunk，保留 chunkOf 及其以 Unicode 码点计的半开 spanStart 和 spanEnd，并以算法数据类型和小写十六进制写法记录所提供的 contentDigest 字面量。保留所有提供的算法，每种算法至多一个不同值。若散列规范化字节，应标明实际输入制品；带类型的摘要本身并不验证字节。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunk|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:c1 a gmeow:Chunk ; gmeow:chunkOf ex:doc ; gmeow:spanStart \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:spanEnd \"512\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:contentDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^gmeow:sha256Digest ."
msgstr "ex:c1 a gmeow:Chunk ; gmeow:chunkOf ex:doc ; gmeow:spanStart \"0\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:spanEnd \"512\"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ; gmeow:contentDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^gmeow:sha256Digest ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSourceDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to pin the exact source revision selected by a Chunking while retaining algorithm identity and the artifact witness."
msgstr "用于固定 Chunking 所选的确切源版本，同时保留算法标识及制品见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSourceDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting a path, IRI, the contract pin, an enclosing result digest or a scheme identifier. Equal hexadecimal text with another datatype does not satisfy this pin."
msgstr "不可用路径、IRI、契约固定值、外围结果摘要或方案标识符替代。相同十六进制文本若具有不同数据类型，仍不满足此固定值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSourceDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Copy one supplied blake3_256Digest, sha256Digest or md5Digest literal from the named chunkingSource artifact without changing its lexical form or datatype. Keep the same literal as a contentDigest on that artifact."
msgstr "从指定 chunkingSource 制品复制一个所提供的 blake3_256Digest、sha256Digest 或 md5Digest 字面量，不改变其词法形式或数据类型。在该制品上保留同一个 contentDigest 字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSourceDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The existing closed-world Chunking contract selects exactly one pin. The witness relation reuses the complete literal term; it does not strip a prefix, equate different datatypes, recompute bytes or prove contract execution. The global contentDigest property remains nonfunctional."
msgstr "现有闭世界 Chunking 契约选定恰好一个固定值。见证关系复用完整字面量项；它不删除前缀、不等同不同数据类型、不重新计算字节，也不证明契约执行。全局 contentDigest 属性仍非函数型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingSourceDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:r gmeow:chunkingSource ex:artifact ; gmeow:chunkingSourceDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^gmeow:sha256Digest . ex:artifact gmeow:contentDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^gmeow:sha256Digest ."
msgstr "ex:r gmeow:chunkingSource ex:artifact ; gmeow:chunkingSourceDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^gmeow:sha256Digest . ex:artifact gmeow:contentDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^gmeow:sha256Digest ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingContractDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to pin the exact contract revision selected by a Chunking while retaining algorithm identity and the artifact witness."
msgstr "用于固定 Chunking 所选的确切契约版本，同时保留算法标识及制品见证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingContractDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting a path, IRI, the source pin, an enclosing result digest or a scheme identifier. Equal hexadecimal text with another datatype does not satisfy this pin."
msgstr "不可用路径、IRI、源固定值、外围结果摘要或方案标识符替代。相同十六进制文本若具有不同数据类型，仍不满足此固定值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingContractDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Copy one supplied blake3_256Digest, sha256Digest or md5Digest literal from the artifact linked by chunkingRulesArtifact without changing its lexical form or datatype. Keep the same literal as a contentDigest on that artifact."
msgstr "从通过 chunkingRulesArtifact 关联的制品复制一个所提供的 blake3_256Digest、sha256Digest 或 md5Digest 字面量，不改变其词法形式或数据类型。在该制品上保留同一个 contentDigest 字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingContractDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The existing closed-world Chunking contract selects exactly one pin. The witness relation reuses the complete literal term; it does not strip a prefix, equate different datatypes, recompute bytes or prove contract execution. The global contentDigest property remains nonfunctional."
msgstr "现有闭世界 Chunking 契约选定恰好一个固定值。见证关系复用完整字面量项；它不删除前缀、不等同不同数据类型、不重新计算字节，也不证明契约执行。全局 contentDigest 属性仍非函数型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkingContractDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:r gmeow:chunkingRulesArtifact ex:artifact ; gmeow:chunkingContractDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^gmeow:sha256Digest . ex:artifact gmeow:contentDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^gmeow:sha256Digest ."
msgstr "ex:r gmeow:chunkingRulesArtifact ex:artifact ; gmeow:chunkingContractDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^gmeow:sha256Digest . ex:artifact gmeow:contentDigest \"0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef\"^^gmeow:sha256Digest ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunk|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Chunk"
msgstr "块"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunk|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid typing the whole source document as a Chunk (the source is a plain gmeow:InformationObject) and avoid re-chunking by re-pointing — a new segmentation mints fresh Chunk individuals, since gmeow:chunkOf is functional."
msgstr "避免将整个源文档声明为 Chunk（源本身是普通 gmeow:InformationObject），也不要通过改指重新分块：新的分块方案应创建新的 Chunk 个体，因为 gmeow:chunkOf 是函数型属性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Chunk|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for a retrieval-sized segment cut from a larger source — the unit a retriever returns, a model reads, and an evidence span pins into; the genuinely missing information-object kind in the Source → Chunk → EvidenceSpan → claim spine."
msgstr "用于从更大来源中切取的检索片段：检索器返回、模型读取、证据范围锚定的单元；它补足 Source → Chunk → EvidenceSpan → 声明节点链中缺少的信息对象种类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisFirstChunkKey|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "analysis first source-chunk key"
msgstr "分析的首个来源块键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisFirstChunkKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied integer key identifying the first source chunk reported for this Analysis's selected input unit."
msgstr "所提供的整数键，标识此 Analysis 所选输入单元的报告首个来源块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisFirstChunkKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Interpret the key only under the supplied source context and key convention. It is not entryOrdinal or spanStart and imposes no global key origin, numeric ordering, continuity or input-byte identity."
msgstr "仅依据已提供的来源上下文和键约定解释此键。它不是 entryOrdinal 或 spanStart，也不强加全局键起点、数值顺序、连续性或输入字节身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisFirstChunkKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record ex:analysis gmeow:analysisFirstChunkKey 12 ; gmeow:analysisLastChunkKey 18 when those endpoint keys were supplied."
msgstr "在已提供这些端点键时，记录 ex:analysis gmeow:analysisFirstChunkKey 12 ; gmeow:analysisLastChunkKey 18。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisFirstChunkKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the first source-chunk key reported for the unit an analysis read."
msgstr "用于保留分析所读取单元的报告首个来源块键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisFirstChunkKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid converting the key into a canonical chunk ordinal, treating it as a code-point start, or assuming the emitted retrieval chunk has the original input text."
msgstr "避免将该键转换为规范的块序号、将其视为码点起始位置，或假定输出的检索块包含原始输入文本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisFirstChunkKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied integer on the Analysis with any supplied last key, source-key frame, construction, chapter and source context. Leave unavailable endpoints and conventions absent rather than inventing them."
msgstr "在 Analysis 上保留所提供的整数，以及已提供的末尾键、来源键框架、构造、章节和来源上下文。不可得的端点和约定保持缺失，不要虚构。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisLastChunkKey|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "analysis last source-chunk key"
msgstr "分析的末个来源块键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisLastChunkKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied integer key identifying the last source chunk reported for this Analysis's selected input unit."
msgstr "所提供的整数键，标识此 Analysis 所选输入单元的报告末个来源块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisLastChunkKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The reported endpoint does not impose a universal inclusive or exclusive convention, consecutive membership, numeric ordering or equality with the first key at chunk granularity. It is not spanEnd."
msgstr "报告端点不强加通用的包含或排除端点约定、连续成员关系、数值顺序，也不要求在块粒度下与首个键相等。它不是 spanEnd。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisLastChunkKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record ex:analysis gmeow:analysisLastChunkKey 18 while retaining the separately supplied first key and source convention."
msgstr "记录 ex:analysis gmeow:analysisLastChunkKey 18，同时保留另行提供的首个键及来源约定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisLastChunkKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the last source-chunk key supplied for the unit an analysis read."
msgstr "用于保留为分析所读取单元提供的末个来源块键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisLastChunkKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding one to obtain a half-open endpoint, equating the key with a code-point bound, or claiming all intervening chunks were present."
msgstr "避免通过加一得到半开端点、将该键等同于码点边界，或断言所有中间块都存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisLastChunkKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the integer unchanged on the Analysis and preserve any supplied input-context descriptors. Interpret endpoint inclusion or source membership only when the source convention actually supplies it."
msgstr "在 Analysis 上原样保留该整数，并保留所提供的输入上下文描述。仅在来源约定实际提供相应含义时，才解释端点是否包含或来源成员关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChunkKeyFrame|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "analysis source-chunk key frame descriptor"
msgstr "分析的来源块键框架描述"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChunkKeyFrame|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied string describing the source-key namespace or indexing convention of this Analysis's reported chunk keys."
msgstr "所提供的字符串，描述此 Analysis 所报告块键的来源键命名空间或索引约定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChunkKeyFrame|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This descriptor preserves stated context; it is not an authenticated coordinate system, complete key inventory or mandatory source artifact. Multiple supplied descriptions may coexist without making the keys globally comparable."
msgstr "此描述保留已声明的上下文；它不是经过认证的坐标系统、完整键清单或必需的来源制品。多个已提供的描述可以共存，但不会因此使这些键具有全局可比性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChunkKeyFrame|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain ex:analysis gmeow:analysisChunkKeyFrame \"source chunk sequence keys\" when that descriptor is supplied."
msgstr "在已提供该描述时，保留 ex:analysis gmeow:analysisChunkKeyFrame \"source chunk sequence keys\"。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChunkKeyFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a source supplies a textual key namespace or indexing-convention descriptor for an analysis input."
msgstr "用于来源为分析输入提供键命名空间或索引约定的文本描述的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChunkKeyFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a zero-origin scheme, treating descriptive text as an executable frame or requiring an artifact when only a descriptor was supplied."
msgstr "避免虚构零起点方案、将描述文本视为可执行框架，或在仅提供描述时要求制品。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChunkKeyFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Copy the supplied xsd:string onto the Analysis alongside its reported keys. Keep an unknown frame unknown; the descriptor does not authenticate a source or compute a key mapping."
msgstr "将所提供的 xsd:string 复制到 Analysis 上，与其报告键一并保留。未知框架保持未知；此描述不认证来源，也不计算键映射。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisInputConstruction|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "analysis input construction description"
msgstr "分析输入构造描述"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisInputConstruction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied description of how this Analysis's input text was assembled, such as its trimming, omission or separator conventions."
msgstr "所提供的描述，说明此 Analysis 的输入文本如何组装，例如其去除首尾空白、略去内容或分隔符约定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisInputConstruction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This specifically named descriptive field preserves its complete string literal. It is not a structured parameter blob, executable profile, frozen artifact, historical-byte witness or claim that a construction was executed."
msgstr "此具有专门名称的描述字段保留其完整字符串字面量。它不是结构化参数数据块、可执行配置、冻结制品、历史字节见证，也不是某次构造已被执行的断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisInputConstruction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain ex:analysis gmeow:analysisInputConstruction \"Join the supplied texts without trimming.\"@en when that description is supplied."
msgstr "在已提供该描述时，保留 ex:analysis gmeow:analysisInputConstruction \"Join the supplied texts without trimming.\"@en。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisInputConstruction|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve supplied prose describing how the selected analysis input was assembled."
msgstr "用于保留已提供的文字描述，说明所选分析输入如何组装。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisInputConstruction|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing unavailable input text or assembly rules, or treating this description as proof that historical input bytes match."
msgstr "避免虚构不可得的输入文本或组装规则，也不要将此描述视为历史输入字节相符的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisInputConstruction|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied description and its language and direction on the Analysis. Retain distinct attributed descriptions as given and leave unknown construction details absent."
msgstr "在 Analysis 上保留所提供的描述及其语言和书写方向。原样保留彼此独立且带有归属信息的描述，未知构造细节保持缺失。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChapterKey|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "analysis source chapter key"
msgstr "分析的来源章节键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChapterKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied integer chapter or chapter-group key affecting the source selection for this Analysis's input."
msgstr "所提供的整数章节键或章节组键，它影响此 Analysis 输入的来源选择。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChapterKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The key retains the source's grouping context without creating a ContentSegment, chapter ordinal or universal numbering scheme. It need not describe a chapter-granularity analysis; another input unit may also be selected within a chapter."
msgstr "此键保留来源的分组上下文，不创建 ContentSegment、章节序号或通用编号方案。它不一定描述章节粒度的分析；其他输入单元也可以在章节内选取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChapterKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain ex:analysis gmeow:analysisChapterKey 4 when that source chapter key accompanies the selected input."
msgstr "在该来源章节键随所选输入提供时，保留 ex:analysis gmeow:analysisChapterKey 4。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChapterKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a supplied chapter or group key affects which source chunks an analysis input selects."
msgstr "用于已提供的章节键或组键影响分析输入所选择来源块的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChapterKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid converting the key into a chapter position, inferring a structural chapter object or assuming it is independent of the source-key frame."
msgstr "避免将该键转换为章节位置、推断结构性章节对象，或假定它独立于来源键框架。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisChapterKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the supplied integer with any reported chunk endpoints and source context. Do not add a missing chapter key or change the analysis granularity merely because this descriptor is present."
msgstr "将所提供的整数与报告的块端点和来源上下文一并保留。不要仅因该描述存在就添加缺失的章节键或改变分析粒度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisSourceContext|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "analysis input source context"
msgstr "分析输入的来源上下文"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisSourceContext|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An actually identified source information object associated with the reported input keys or source selection of this Analysis."
msgstr "实际已标识的来源信息对象，与此 Analysis 所报告的输入键或来源选择相关联。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisSourceContext|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The link records supplied source context. It does not by itself identify immutable analyzer-input bytes, certify an exact source revision or turn the Analysis result into a text carrier. Several attributed source-context links may coexist."
msgstr "此链接记录已提供的来源上下文。它本身不标识不可变的分析器输入字节，不证明确切来源修订，也不将 Analysis 结果变成文本载体。多个带有归属信息的来源上下文链接可以共存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisSourceContext|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record ex:analysis gmeow:analysisSourceContext ex:sourceRecord when that source information object is actually identified."
msgstr "在实际已标识该来源信息对象时，记录 ex:analysis gmeow:analysisSourceContext ex:sourceRecord。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisSourceContext|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an identified source object supplied as context for an analysis input's chunk keys or selection."
msgstr "用于保留已标识且作为分析输入块键或选择上下文提供的来源对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisSourceContext|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid minting a source object to fill missing evidence, treating a mutable source identity as authenticated input bytes or requiring an unsupported digest."
msgstr "避免为填补缺失证据而创建来源对象、将可变来源身份视为经过认证的输入字节，或要求缺乏依据的摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/analysisSourceContext|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link only the actual supplied InformationObject and retain its stated role alongside any input descriptors. Omit the relation when no source object is supplied; this property neither reconstructs nor authenticates text."
msgstr "仅链接实际提供的 InformationObject，并与输入描述一并保留其已声明角色。未提供来源对象时省略此关系；此属性既不重构也不认证文本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChunk|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunk input granularity"
msgstr "块输入粒度"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChunk|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The open text-unit granularity value for an input reported at chunk resolution under its source's chunk convention."
msgstr "一种开放的文本单元粒度值，表示依据来源自身的块约定按块分辨率报告的输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChunk|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is a resolution individual, not a class of chunks or a fixed text length. It does not equate source keys with retrieval chunks, require equal endpoint keys or establish a universal granularity ordering."
msgstr "这是分辨率个体，不是块类或固定文本长度。它不将来源键等同于检索块，不要求端点键相等，也不建立通用粒度顺序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChunk|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record ex:analysis gmeow:hasGranularity gmeow:granularityChunk when chunk input granularity was supplied."
msgstr "在已提供块输入粒度时，记录 ex:analysis gmeow:hasGranularity gmeow:granularityChunk。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChunk|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when an analysis input or another text-unit record is explicitly described at chunk granularity."
msgstr "用于分析输入或其他文本单元记录被明确描述为块粒度的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChunk|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring chunk size, source coordinates, key conventions or a specific chunking solely from this value."
msgstr "避免仅凭此值推断块大小、来源坐标、键约定或特定分块方案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChunk|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference this individual through hasGranularity and preserve the supplied source and input descriptors separately. Keep other attributed granularity values without selecting a winner."
msgstr "通过 hasGranularity 引用此个体，并另行保留所提供的来源和输入描述。保留其他带有归属信息的粒度值，不选择唯一胜出者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityPassage|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "passage input granularity"
msgstr "篇段输入粒度"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityPassage|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The open text-unit granularity value for an input reported at passage resolution under its source's passage convention."
msgstr "一种开放的文本单元粒度值，表示依据来源自身的篇段约定按篇段分辨率报告的输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityPassage|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A passage has no universal size, chunk count or required position in a granularity ladder. This individual supplies no assembly rule, contiguous-source-cut claim or identity with a structural ContentSegment."
msgstr "篇段没有通用大小、块数量或在粒度层级中的必需位置。此个体不提供组装规则、连续来源截段断言或与结构性 ContentSegment 的同一身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityPassage|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record ex:analysis gmeow:hasGranularity gmeow:granularityPassage while retaining any supplied first and last source-chunk keys."
msgstr "记录 ex:analysis gmeow:hasGranularity gmeow:granularityPassage，同时保留已提供的首个和末个来源块键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityPassage|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source explicitly describes the selected input unit as a passage."
msgstr "用于来源明确将所选输入单元描述为篇段的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityPassage|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving a passage's text, boundaries, size or relation to chapter granularity from this value alone."
msgstr "避免仅凭此值推导篇段的文本、边界、大小或其与章节粒度的关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityPassage|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Use hasGranularity to retain this supplied resolution and keep source-key, construction and grouping descriptors separately. Do not invent a fixed passage segmentation or a coarserThan edge."
msgstr "使用 hasGranularity 保留所提供的分辨率，并另行保留来源键、构造和分组描述。不要虚构固定的篇段划分或 coarserThan 边。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChapter|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chapter input granularity"
msgstr "章节输入粒度"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChapter|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The open text-unit granularity value for an input reported at chapter resolution under its source's chapter convention."
msgstr "一种开放的文本单元粒度值，表示依据来源自身的章节约定按章节分辨率报告的输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChapter|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This resolution value does not create or identify a chapter ContentSegment, select a numbering origin or prove that the input equals a structural chapter's exact text. Chapter grouping and input construction remain separate supplied context."
msgstr "此分辨率值不创建或标识章节 ContentSegment，不选择编号起点，也不证明输入等于某个结构性章节的确切文本。章节分组和输入构造仍是另行提供的上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChapter|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record ex:analysis gmeow:hasGranularity gmeow:granularityChapter and retain a supplied analysisChapterKey separately."
msgstr "记录 ex:analysis gmeow:hasGranularity gmeow:granularityChapter，并另行保留已提供的 analysisChapterKey。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChapter|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when an analysis input or another text-unit record is explicitly described at chapter granularity."
msgstr "用于分析输入或其他文本单元记录被明确描述为章节粒度的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChapter|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring chapter identity, chapter order, input bytes or a universal relation to passage or chunk granularity."
msgstr "避免推断章节身份、章节顺序、输入字节，或其与篇段或块粒度的通用关系。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityChapter|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain this individual through hasGranularity alongside any supplied source-context and chapter-key descriptors. Preserve other attributed resolutions without merging their conventions."
msgstr "通过 hasGranularity 保留此个体及所提供的来源上下文和章节键描述。保留其他带有归属信息的分辨率，不合并它们的约定。"


msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkInDivision|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunk in source division"
msgstr "片段所在的来源分区"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkInDivision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source division containing the whole particular occurrence of source content represented by this Chunk under the supplied segmentation."
msgstr "在所提供的分段中，完整包含此 Chunk 所对应的那一处来源内容的来源分区。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkInDivision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The relation is optional and nonfunctional; nested divisions genuinely containing the whole occurrence can coexist. It specializes broad partOf without changing chunkOf or making a Chunk a structural ContentSegment. Recording containment does not prove it, compute a nearest ancestor or convert coordinates."
msgstr "该关系可省略且非函数式；真正完整包含该处内容的嵌套分区可以共存。它细化广义 partOf，但不改变 chunkOf，也不将 Chunk 视为结构性 ContentSegment。记录包含关系不等于证明该关系、计算最近祖先或转换坐标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkInDivision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "With actual attribution retained, record ex:chunk gmeow:chunkOf ex:source ; gmeow:chunkInDivision ex:section . The section contains the whole represented source occurrence."
msgstr "保留实际归属，并记录 ex:chunk gmeow:chunkOf ex:source ; gmeow:chunkInDivision ex:section . 该节完整包含所表示的那一处来源内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkInDivision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a source or attributed analysis supplies a division containing the whole occurrence of source content represented by a Chunk."
msgstr "当来源或有归属的分析提供了完整包含某个 Chunk 所对应的那一处来源内容的分区时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkInDivision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using it for a merely intersected division, matching wording elsewhere, an arbitrary association or a generated summary's subject division without actual whole-content containment."
msgstr "避免将其用于仅与片段相交的分区、其他位置的相同措辞或任意关联。若生成摘要所概述的原始分区并未实际包含片段表示的全部内容，也不要将其作为目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkInDivision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the actual Chunk to each supplied containing ContentSegment, preserving the actual source and exact-statement attribution. Retain any existing inChunking context and leave chunkOf, span bounds and source/digest pins unchanged; keep an unknown container absent."
msgstr "将实际的 Chunk 关联到每个已提供的包含它的 ContentSegment，并保留实际来源和确切断言的归属。保留任何现有的 inChunking 上下文，不改变 chunkOf、跨度边界、来源固定值与散列摘要固定值；容器未知时保持缺失。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityWork|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "whole-work input granularity"
msgstr "整部作品输入粒度"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityWork|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The open text-unit granularity value for an input reported at whole-work resolution under its source's work convention."
msgstr "一种开放的文本单元粒度值，表示依据来源自身的作品约定按整部作品分辨率报告的输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityWork|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This resolution value does not create or identify an abstract Work or a particular realization. A whole file or document does not establish whole-work scope. The value does not authenticate complete coverage or imply that every edition, language or realization was read."
msgstr "此分辨率值不创建或标识抽象的 Work 或某个特定实现。完整的文件或文档并不确立整部作品的范围。此值不认证覆盖完整性，也不意味着每个版本、语言或实现都已被读取。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityWork|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record ex:analysis gmeow:hasGranularity gmeow:granularityWork only when whole-work input granularity was supplied."
msgstr "仅在已提供整部作品输入粒度时，记录 ex:analysis gmeow:hasGranularity gmeow:granularityWork。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityWork|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when an analysis input or another text-unit record is explicitly described at whole-work granularity."
msgstr "用于分析输入或其他文本单元记录被明确描述为整部作品粒度的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityWork|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring this value from a whole file, document, title or Work identity, or using it to claim reconstructed input bytes or complete source coverage."
msgstr "避免根据完整文件、文档、标题或 Work 身份推断此值，也不要用它声称已重建输入字节或完整覆盖来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/granularityWork|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference this individual through hasGranularity and retain any supplied source, source-key and construction descriptors separately. Leave unknown work conventions unknown and preserve other attributed resolutions without selecting a winner."
msgstr "通过 hasGranularity 引用此个体，并另行保留所提供的来源、来源键和构造描述。让未知的作品约定保持未知，并保留其他带有归属信息的分辨率，不选定优先项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerName|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported chunker name"
msgstr "报告的分块器名称"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact name supplied for the chunker associated with this Chunking."
msgstr "为与此 Chunking 关联的分块器提供的确切名称。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional text preserves a reported label, not an executable identity or proof that a named implementation ran. Equal names do not identify algorithms, rules artifacts or chunkings."
msgstr "此可省略、非函数式文本保留报告的标签，不代表可执行身份，也不证明某个具名实现已运行。名称相同不确立算法、规则制品或分块结果的同一性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerName|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain supplied wording: ex:segmentation gmeow:chunkerName \"Outline cutter\" ."
msgstr "保留提供的措辞：ex:segmentation gmeow:chunkerName \"Outline cutter\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a source supplies a chunker name for the recorded segmentation."
msgstr "当来源为所记录的分块结果提供分块器名称时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving a name from the rules artifact, normalizing its spelling or treating it as a callable signature, model run or preferred implementation."
msgstr "避免从规则制品推导名称、规范化其拼写，或将其视为可调用签名、模型运行或首选实现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerName|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep each supplied string with its original lexical form, language and direction on the actual Chunking. Retain exact-statement attribution and leave a missing name absent."
msgstr "在实际的 Chunking 上保留每个提供的字符串及其原始词法形式、语言和方向。保留确切断言的归属；名称缺失时保持缺失。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerVersion|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported chunker version"
msgstr "报告的分块器版本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact version wording supplied for the chunker associated with this Chunking."
msgstr "为与此 Chunking 关联的分块器提供的确切版本措辞。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional text imposes no version grammar, ordering or identity rule. It neither replaces the frozen rules-artifact digest nor pairs every reported name with every version or parameter map."
msgstr "此可省略、非函数式文本不强加版本语法、排序或身份规则。它既不替代冻结规则制品的摘要，也不将每个报告的名称与每个版本或参数映射配对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerVersion|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain supplied wording: ex:segmentation gmeow:chunkerVersion \"edition amber\" ."
msgstr "保留提供的措辞：ex:segmentation gmeow:chunkerVersion \"edition amber\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerVersion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a source supplies version wording for the recorded chunker."
msgstr "当来源为所记录的分块器提供版本措辞时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerVersion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a missing version, parsing it as a numeric magnitude or using a name and version as proof of implementation identity or execution."
msgstr "避免编造缺失版本、将其解析为数值量，或用名称和版本证明实现身份或执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerVersion|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the complete supplied string and its exact-statement source and viewpoint. Keep the actual rules artifact and its selected digest pin separately; leave unknown version information absent."
msgstr "保留完整的提供字符串及其确切断言的来源和视角。另行保留实际规则制品及其选定摘要固定值；未知版本信息保持缺失。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerParameters|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported chunker parameters"
msgstr "报告的分块器参数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerParameters|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied map occurrence retaining the descriptive parameter strings reported for this Chunking."
msgstr "所提供的映射出现实例，保留为此 Chunking 报告的描述性参数字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerParameters|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional relation selects a StructuredMap of exact string keys and descriptive text values. A typed empty map differs from an absent map. Independent maps remain separate; the relation asserts neither executable arguments nor a complete external inventory."
msgstr "此可省略、非函数式关系选取由确切字符串键和描述性文本值组成的 StructuredMap。已注明类型的空映射不同于缺失的映射。独立映射保持分离；此关系既不声明可执行实参，也不声明外部清单完整。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerParameters|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Link a supplied map: ex:segmentation gmeow:chunkerParameters ex:parameters . ex:parameters a gmeow:StructuredMap ."
msgstr "关联所提供的映射：ex:segmentation gmeow:chunkerParameters ex:parameters . ex:parameters a gmeow:StructuredMap ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerParameters|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain each supplied parameter key and its descriptive string as queryable graph content for a Chunking."
msgstr "用于将每个提供的参数键及其描述性字符串保留为 Chunking 的可查询图内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerParameters|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid an opaque JSON blob, keys turned into predicates, numeric coercion, invented units or order, or replacing the actual rules artifact with these descriptions."
msgstr "避免使用不透明 JSON 块、将键转为谓词、进行数值强制转换、编造单位或顺序，或用这些描述替代实际规则制品。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkerParameters|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the Chunking to each supplied StructuredMap. Retain one LabelledFacet per entry with its exact xsd:string facetLabel and complete facetText; preserve attribution, empty strings and any supplied language or direction without inventing ordinals."
msgstr "将 Chunking 关联到每个提供的 StructuredMap。每个条目保留一个 LabelledFacet，带有确切的 xsd:string facetLabel 和完整的 facetText；保留归属、空字符串及任何提供的语言或方向，不编造序号。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterTextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunker parameter descriptive text"
msgstr "分块器参数描述文本"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterTextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every facet entry in a map selected by chunkerParameters carries its descriptive text through facetText."
msgstr "由 chunkerParameters 选取的映射中的每个分面条目都通过 facetText 携带其描述文本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterTextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The requirement is scoped to selected chunker maps. Generic label-only facets remain valid elsewhere; an empty parameter map requires no invented entry."
msgstr "此要求仅限于选取的分块器映射。其他位置仍允许只有标签的通用分面；空参数映射不要求编造条目。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterTextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A selected map entry retains ex:entry gmeow:facetText \"Keep headings together.\" ."
msgstr "选取的映射条目保留 ex:entry gmeow:facetText \"Keep headings together.\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterTextConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject a selected parameter entry whose descriptive value is missing."
msgstr "用于拒绝缺少描述性值的已选参数条目。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterTextConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid satisfying this law with a null, typed numeric value, nested payload or fabricated empty string."
msgstr "避免用空值、带类型的数值、嵌套载荷或编造的空字符串满足此规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterTextConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Follow chunkerParameters and hasFacet, then require facetText on each supplied entry. Reuse the existing text range, functionality and payload-exclusion laws without changing generic facet semantics."
msgstr "沿 chunkerParameters 和 hasFacet 查找，并要求每个提供的条目具有 facetText。复用现有文本值域、函数性和载荷互斥规则，不改变通用分面语义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyDatatypeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunker parameter exact string key"
msgstr "分块器参数确切字符串键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyDatatypeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every supplied facetLabel in a map selected by chunkerParameters has exactly the xsd:string datatype."
msgstr "由 chunkerParameters 选取的映射中的每个已提供 facetLabel 的数据类型都必须恰为 xsd:string。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyDatatypeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This checks the original literal datatype without trimming, retyping or interpreting the key. Empty string keys remain valid; generic maps retain their existing key types."
msgstr "此检查核对原始字面量的数据类型，不修剪空白、不重设类型，也不解释键。空字符串键仍然有效；通用映射保留其现有键类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyDatatypeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied plain key remains ex:entry gmeow:facetLabel \"section policy\" ."
msgstr "提供的普通键仍为 ex:entry gmeow:facetLabel \"section policy\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyDatatypeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check that selected chunker parameter keys retain the source string datatype."
msgstr "用于检查选取的分块器参数键是否保留来源字符串数据类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyDatatypeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting token, language-tagged, numeric or resource keys by converting them into strings."
msgstr "避免将 token、带语言标签、数值或资源键转换为字符串后予以接受。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyDatatypeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind each selected entry and its facetLabel, then compare the label's datatype component with xsd:string through termSameComponent. Keep the supplied term unchanged and report a mismatch."
msgstr "绑定每个选取的条目及其 facetLabel，然后通过 termSameComponent 将标签的数据类型分量与 xsd:string 比较。保持所提供的项不变，并报告不匹配。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunker parameter map key uniqueness"
msgstr "分块器参数映射键唯一性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Distinct entry occurrences in one map selected by chunkerParameters do not share the same complete RDF key term."
msgstr "由 chunkerParameters 选取的同一映射中的不同条目出现实例不得共享同一个完整 RDF 键项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The comparison is local to one selected map and uses whole-term identity for both keys and entry occurrences. Equal keys in different maps remain independent; no identity merge or preferred value follows."
msgstr "比较仅限于一个选取的映射，并对键和条目出现实例都使用完整项同一性。不同映射中的相同键保持独立；不会导出身份合并或首选值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyUniquenessConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Two different entries of ex:parameters cannot both carry the same complete facetLabel literal."
msgstr "ex:parameters 的两个不同条目不能同时携带同一个完整 facetLabel 字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject duplicate key occurrences within a supplied chunker parameter map."
msgstr "用于拒绝所提供分块器参数映射内部重复的键出现实例。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid global key uniqueness, key-derived entry identities, sameAs merging, last-value selection or SPARQL value equality in place of RDF term identity."
msgstr "避免全局键唯一性、由键派生条目身份、sameAs 合并、选择最后一个值，或用 SPARQL 值相等替代 RDF 项同一性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkerParameterKeyUniquenessConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind two entries and both keys through the same selected map. Compare complete key terms with termSameComponent; matching keys require the same complete entry term, otherwise preserve the records and report the conflict."
msgstr "通过同一个选取的映射绑定两个条目及其两个键。使用 termSameComponent 比较完整键项；匹配的键要求同一个完整条目项，否则保留记录并报告冲突。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreRegression|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "regression score"
msgstr "回归分数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreRegression|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A model-predicted scalar for the output dimension identified by the emitted ClassifierLabel, rather than a probability."
msgstr "模型为已发出的 ClassifierLabel 所标识的输出维度预测的标量，而非概率。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreRegression|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This declares regression meaning for the raw decimal classifierScore. It supplies no universal range, scale, unit, calibration, epistemic confidence, evidence strength or decision policy. The named output dimension is a model output identity, not an invented mathematical dimension."
msgstr "此值声明原始十进制 classifierScore 的回归语义。它不提供通用的范围、尺度、单位、校准、认识论置信度、证据强度或决策策略。所命名的输出维度是模型输出的身份，而非虚构的数学维度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreRegression|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Record ex:output gmeow:classifierScore -1.25 ; gmeow:scoreSemantics gmeow:scoreRegression ; gmeow:emittedLabel ex:dimensionLabel . Retain the actual run and source attribution separately."
msgstr "记录 ex:output gmeow:classifierScore -1.25 ; gmeow:scoreSemantics gmeow:scoreRegression ; gmeow:emittedLabel ex:dimensionLabel . 另行保留实际运行及来源归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreRegression|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a model emits a scalar regression prediction for an explicitly identified output dimension."
msgstr "用于模型为明确标识的输出维度发出标量回归预测的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreRegression|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the score as a probability, calibration, confidence or evidence strength, assuming a unit interval, argmax or threshold, or replacing actual quantity measurements with this raw model score."
msgstr "避免将该分数视为概率、校准、置信度或证据强度，假定单位区间、argmax 或阈值，或用此原始模型分数替代实际的量值测量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/scoreRegression|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Declare this individual through scoreSemantics on the output, retain its exact classifierScore and emittedLabel, and preserve producedBy with the actual ModelInferenceRun, model revision, input and source provenance. Keep any separately supplied interpretation context without inventing a scale, unit or decision rule."
msgstr "通过输出上的 scoreSemantics 声明此个体，保留确切的 classifierScore 和 emittedLabel，并通过 producedBy 保留实际的 ModelInferenceRun、模型修订、输入和来源溯源。保留任何另行提供的解释上下文，不虚构尺度、单位或决策规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkSpan|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Chunk Span"
msgstr "块跨度"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkSpan|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An identified source-text input unit reported as a range of source chunks under its supplied selection context."
msgstr "在所提供的选择上下文中，作为来源块范围报告的已标识来源文本输入单元。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkSpan|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This EvidenceSpan specialization identifies the selected content unit and inherits InformationObject. Its supplied identity is not determined by endpoint integers, wording or granularity alone, and it need not be a contiguous retrieval Chunk."
msgstr "此 EvidenceSpan 特化标识所选内容单元，并继承 InformationObject。仅凭端点整数、措辞或粒度不能确定其所提供的标识；它不一定是连续的检索 Chunk。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkSpan|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a classifier or Measurement reports an input unit spanning source chunks under a supplied selection context."
msgstr "用于分类器或 Measurement 报告在所提供的选择上下文中跨越来源块的输入单元时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkSpan|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid typing an output or an input descriptor as the selected content, wrapping every existing Chunk, or adding a second ultimate Kind to a Chunk or ContentSegment."
msgstr "不要将输出或输入描述符定型为所选内容，不要为每个已有 Chunk 创建包装，也不要为 Chunk 或 ContentSegment 添加第二个最终 Kind。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkSpan|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Point classifiedTarget or observedFeature to the actual supplied unit identity. Keep granularity and supplied descriptors on that unit; keep outputs, runs and results separate. Reuse an actual existing Chunk with its complete contract."
msgstr "将 classifiedTarget 或 observedFeature 指向实际提供的单元标识。将粒度和所提供的描述信息保留在该单元上；输出、运行记录和结果保持分离。若实际输入是已有 Chunk，则复用其标识及完整契约。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkSpan|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Identify the selected content: ex:output gmeow:classifiedTarget ex:unit . ex:unit a gmeow:ChunkSpan ."
msgstr "标识所选内容：ex:output gmeow:classifiedTarget ex:unit . ex:unit a gmeow:ChunkSpan ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanFirstKey|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunk span first source-chunk key"
msgstr "块跨度的首个来源块键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanFirstKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied integer key identifying the first source chunk reported for this ChunkSpan."
msgstr "为此 ChunkSpan 报告的首个来源块的已提供整数键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanFirstKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional key is at most one per coherent ChunkSpan. It is a source identifier, not an ordinal, code-point coordinate, count or numeric magnitude."
msgstr "每个一致的 ChunkSpan 至多具有一个此类可选键。它是来源标识符，不是序号、码点坐标、计数或数值量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanFirstKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the first source-chunk key supplied for the selected input unit."
msgstr "用于保留为所选输入单元提供的首个来源块键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanFirstKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid converting the key into entryOrdinal or spanStart, inventing a key origin or inferring continuity from endpoint values."
msgstr "不要将该键转换为 entryOrdinal 或 spanStart，不要虚构键的起点，也不要根据端点值推断连续性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanFirstKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied integer on the ChunkSpan with any supplied last key, chapter key, key frame, construction and source context. Leave an unavailable first key absent."
msgstr "将提供的整数保留在 ChunkSpan 上，同时保留已提供的末键、章节键、键框架、构造描述和来源上下文。未提供首键时保持缺失。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanFirstKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain the reported first key: ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanFirstKey 12 ."
msgstr "保留报告的首键：ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanFirstKey 12 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanLastKey|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunk span last source-chunk key"
msgstr "块跨度的末个来源块键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanLastKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied integer key identifying the last source chunk reported for this ChunkSpan."
msgstr "为此 ChunkSpan 报告的末个来源块的已提供整数键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanLastKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional key is at most one per coherent ChunkSpan. It establishes no inclusive or exclusive convention, numeric order, consecutive membership or equality with the first key."
msgstr "每个一致的 ChunkSpan 至多具有一个此类可选键。它不确立端点包含或排除约定、数值顺序、连续成员关系，也不确立与首键相等。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanLastKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the last source-chunk key supplied for the selected input unit."
msgstr "用于保留为所选输入单元提供的末个来源块键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanLastKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid adding one to form a half-open bound, treating the key as spanEnd or claiming every intervening chunk was selected."
msgstr "不要加一以构造半开边界，不要将该键视为 spanEnd，也不要声称已选择所有中间块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanLastKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the integer unchanged on the ChunkSpan and keep any supplied first key and selection context. Interpret endpoint inclusion only under an actually supplied convention."
msgstr "将整数原样保留在 ChunkSpan 上，并保留已提供的首键和选择上下文。仅依据实际提供的约定解释端点是否包含。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanLastKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain the reported last key: ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanLastKey 18 ."
msgstr "保留报告的末键：ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanLastKey 18 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanChapterKey|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunk span source chapter key"
msgstr "块跨度的来源章节键"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanChapterKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied integer chapter or chapter-group key affecting the source selection for this ChunkSpan."
msgstr "影响此 ChunkSpan 来源选择的已提供整数章节键或章节分组键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanChapterKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional key is at most one per coherent ChunkSpan. It retains grouping context without creating a ContentSegment, chapter ordinal or numbering convention."
msgstr "每个一致的 ChunkSpan 至多具有一个此类可选键。它保留分组上下文，不创建 ContentSegment、章节序号或编号约定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanChapterKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a supplied chapter or group key affects which source chunks the input selects."
msgstr "用于已提供的章节或分组键影响输入选择哪些来源块时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanChapterKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid converting the key into a structural chapter position or inferring chapter granularity solely from its presence."
msgstr "不要将该键转换为结构性章节位置，也不要仅因其存在就推断章节粒度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanChapterKey|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve the integer with the ChunkSpan's supplied endpoint and source descriptors. A different grouping selection uses its own actual unit identity."
msgstr "将整数与为 ChunkSpan 提供的端点和来源描述信息一起保留。不同分组下的选择使用其各自的实际单元标识。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanChapterKey|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain the supplied grouping key: ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanChapterKey 4 ."
msgstr "保留提供的分组键：ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanChapterKey 4 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanKeyFrame|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunk span source-key frame descriptor"
msgstr "块跨度的来源键框架描述"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanKeyFrame|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied string describing the source-key namespace or indexing convention of this ChunkSpan's reported chunk keys."
msgstr "描述此 ChunkSpan 所报告块键的来源键命名空间或索引约定的已提供字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanKeyFrame|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional descriptor preserves stated context without authenticating a coordinate system or complete key inventory. Several attributed descriptions may coexist."
msgstr "此可选描述符保留已陈述的上下文，不认证坐标系或完整键清单。多个带有归属信息的描述可以并存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanKeyFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a source supplies a textual key namespace or indexing-convention descriptor for a selected chunk span."
msgstr "用于来源为所选块跨度提供文本形式的键命名空间或索引约定描述时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanKeyFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a zero-origin scheme, computing a key mapping from prose or treating equal descriptions as shared source identity."
msgstr "不要虚构从零开始的方案，不要根据文字描述计算键映射，也不要将相同描述视为共享来源标识。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanKeyFrame|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Copy the supplied xsd:string onto the ChunkSpan alongside its reported keys. Keep an unknown key frame unknown and retain exact-statement attribution."
msgstr "将提供的 xsd:string 复制到 ChunkSpan 上，与其报告的键一起保留。未知的键框架保持未知，并保留精确陈述的归属信息。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanKeyFrame|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain a supplied key descriptor: ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanKeyFrame \"source sequence keys\" ."
msgstr "保留提供的键描述符：ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanKeyFrame \"source sequence keys\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanConstruction|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunk span input construction description"
msgstr "块跨度输入构造描述"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanConstruction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied description of how this ChunkSpan's selected input text was assembled, including stated trimming, omission or separator conventions."
msgstr "描述此 ChunkSpan 的所选输入文本如何组装的已提供说明，包括已陈述的空白修剪、省略或分隔约定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanConstruction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional descriptive field preserves the complete literal, including actual language and direction. It is not an executable profile, structured parameter blob or historical-byte witness."
msgstr "此可选描述字段保留完整字面量，包括其实际语言和方向。它不是可执行配置、结构化参数块或历史字节凭证。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanConstruction|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve supplied prose describing the assembly of a reported chunk-span input."
msgstr "用于保留描述所报告块跨度输入如何组装的已提供文字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanConstruction|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing unavailable text or assembly rules, interpreting the prose as execution evidence or normalizing its supplied literal."
msgstr "不要虚构未提供的文本或组装规则，不要将文字描述解释为执行证据，也不要规范化所提供的字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanConstruction|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied string and any actual language tag and direction on the ChunkSpan. Retain competing attributed descriptions separately; leave unknown construction details absent."
msgstr "将提供的字符串及其实际已有的语言标签和方向保留在 ChunkSpan 上。分别保留相互竞争且带有归属信息的描述；未知的构造细节保持缺失。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanConstruction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain the supplied assembly description: ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanConstruction \"Join without trimming.\"@en ."
msgstr "保留提供的组装描述：ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanConstruction \"Join without trimming.\"@en ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanSourceContext|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "chunk span input source context"
msgstr "块跨度输入的来源上下文"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanSourceContext|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An actually identified source InformationObject supplied as context for this ChunkSpan's reported keys or source selection."
msgstr "作为此 ChunkSpan 所报告键或来源选择的上下文而提供的、实际已标识的来源 InformationObject。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanSourceContext|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional link records supplied source context without certifying an immutable source revision, historical input bytes or derivation. Several attributed source-context links may coexist."
msgstr "此可选链接记录所提供的来源上下文，不证明不可变来源版本、历史输入字节或派生关系。多个带有归属信息的来源上下文链接可以并存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanSourceContext|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain an identified source object supplied as context for a selected chunk span."
msgstr "用于保留作为所选块跨度上下文而提供的已标识来源对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanSourceContext|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid minting a source object to fill missing evidence or using chunkOf, navigationSource, segmentOf or wasDerivedFrom for a merely contextual link."
msgstr "不要为了填补缺失证据而创建来源对象，也不要将 chunkOf、navigationSource、segmentOf 或 wasDerivedFrom 用于仅表示上下文的链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanSourceContext|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link only an actual supplied InformationObject and retain its stated contextual role. Keep absent source identity absent; this relation reconstructs no text and requires no invented digest."
msgstr "仅链接实际提供的 InformationObject，并保留其已陈述的上下文角色。未提供来源标识时保持缺失；此关系不重建文本，也不要求虚构摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSpanSourceContext|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain the identified source context: ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanSourceContext ex:source ."
msgstr "保留已标识的来源上下文：ex:unit gmeow:chunkSpanSourceContext ex:source ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/measuredTerm|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "measured keyword wording"
msgstr "测量关键词的原始措辞"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/measuredTerm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The keyword wording supplied for this Measurement, retaining its complete string literal."
msgstr "为此 Measurement 提供的关键词措辞，保留其完整字符串字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/measuredTerm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Optional and nonfunctional. Preserve lexical form, datatype and supplied language and direction; infer no Form, concept, entity, name, tokenization, occurrence identity or source span."
msgstr "可省略且非函数式。保留词法形式、数据类型及实际提供的语言和方向；不推断 Form、概念、实体、名称、分词、出现身份或来源跨度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/measuredTerm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain ex:reading gmeow:measuredTerm \"silver river\" when that untagged wording was supplied."
msgstr "当来源提供了此无语言标签的措辞时，保留 ex:reading gmeow:measuredTerm \"silver river\"。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/measuredTerm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to keep supplied keyword wording beside the separate size, source rank and weight of the actual Measurement."
msgstr "用于在实际 Measurement 上保留所提供的关键词措辞，并分别保留大小、来源排名及权重。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/measuredTerm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid normalization, translation, guessed language, referent resolution from equal spelling or replacement of the observed unit or weight result."
msgstr "避免规范化、翻译、猜测语言、根据相同拼写解析指称对象，或替换被观察单元或权重结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/measuredTerm|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the complete supplied literal on the source row's Measurement with observedFeature, measurementMetric, vantage, observationMethod and the separate observationResult. Use distinct records for different rows or conventions."
msgstr "在来源行的 Measurement 上保留完整的已提供字面量，以及 observedFeature、measurementMetric、vantage、observationMethod 和独立的 observationResult。不同来源行或约定使用不同记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ngramSize|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "n-gram size"
msgstr "n-gram 大小"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ngramSize|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The dimensionless positive integral count of gram positions for this keyword Measurement under its actual segmentation and counting convention, carried by a math:Quantity."
msgstr "此关键词 Measurement 在实际切分与计数约定下的 n-gram 位置数，由 math:Quantity 承载，是无量纲的正整数计数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ngramSize|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The count Quantity is separate from the keyword weight observationResult. Each selected count requires a positive integer-family magnitude, math:dimensionless and an actual applicable reference frame. Repeated positions remain counted."
msgstr "计数 Quantity 与关键词权重的 observationResult 分开。每个选定计数都需要正的整数族数值、math:dimensionless 和实际适用的参考框架。重复位置仍计入数量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ngramSize|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Link ex:reading gmeow:ngramSize ex:count, retaining quantityValue 2, dimension math:dimensionless and the supplied counting frame on ex:count."
msgstr "通过 ex:reading gmeow:ngramSize ex:count 建立关联，在 ex:count 上保留 quantityValue 2、math:dimensionless 维度及所提供的计数框架。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ngramSize|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the actual keyword gram size and its segmentation/counting convention are available as a positive integral count."
msgstr "用于实际关键词的 n-gram 大小及其切分与计数约定已作为正整数计数提供的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ngramSize|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid asserting a raw code or sentinel as size, deriving size from whitespace, substituting character length or keyword-row count, deduplicating positions or inventing a missing frame."
msgstr "避免把原始代码或哨兵值断言为大小、根据空白推导大小、用字符长度或关键词行数替代大小、对位置去重，或虚构缺失的框架。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ngramSize|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Point the Measurement to its count Quantity with original integer-family quantityValue, dimensionless dimension and actual hasReferenceFrame. Keep wording, source rank and weight separate, preserving distinct rows and conventions without inferring execution."
msgstr "将 Measurement 指向其计数 Quantity，并保留原始整数族 quantityValue、无量纲维度和实际的 hasReferenceFrame。分别保留措辞、来源排名和权重，保留不同来源行及约定，不推断执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/termRank|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported keyword rank"
msgstr "来源报告的关键词排名"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/termRank|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The source-reported integer ordering position or rank of this keyword Measurement within its actual observed unit and producing context."
msgstr "来源报告的此关键词 Measurement 在实际被观察单元和生成上下文中的整数顺序位置或排名。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/termRank|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Optional and nonfunctional. Unknown origin, direction, gaps and tie conventions stay unknown. An integer datatype does not turn an unrelated code into a rank or equate source order with relevance rank."
msgstr "可省略且非函数式。未知的起点、方向、间隔及并列约定仍保持未知。整数数据类型不会把无关代码变为排名，也不会使来源顺序等同于相关性排名。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/termRank|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain ex:reading gmeow:termRank 4 when the source reported that keyword rank, without shifting it to an assumed origin."
msgstr "当来源报告了此关键词排名时，保留 ex:reading gmeow:termRank 4，不将其平移为假定的起点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/termRank|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the source's stated keyword ordering position or rank within the Measurement's actual unit and source context."
msgstr "用于来源在 Measurement 的实际单元和来源上下文中声明的关键词顺序位置或排名。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/termRank|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing rank from weight or row order, assuming zero or one origin, imposing bounds, continuity, uniqueness or tie rules, treating rank as confidence or copying it unchanged into entryOrdinal."
msgstr "避免根据权重或行顺序虚构排名、假定从零或一开始、强加边界、连续性、唯一性或并列规则、把排名当作置信度，或原样复制到 entryOrdinal。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/termRank|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the supplied xsd:integer ordering descriptor on its source row's Measurement with actual observedFeature, method, vantage and attribution. Preserve supplied ranking conventions; comparison, renumbering and list reconstruction require the actual convention."
msgstr "在来源行的 Measurement 上保留所提供的 xsd:integer 顺序描述，以及实际的 observedFeature、方法、vantage 和归属。保留来源提供的排名约定；比较、重新编号及列表重建需要实际约定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeContextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "n-gram size context constraint"
msgstr "n-gram 大小上下文约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeContextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every count selected by ngramSize has a magnitude, only the dimensionless dimension, a reference-frame witness and numerically agreeing magnitude values."
msgstr "由 ngramSize 选定的每个计数都具有数值、仅有无量纲维度和参考框架见证，且其各数值在数值意义上一致。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeContextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The condition follows each supplied ngramSize edge. It neither requires size on every Measurement nor constrains unrelated Quantities, merges rows or authenticates a frame's actual applicability."
msgstr "此条件沿每条已提供的 ngramSize 边检查。它不要求每个 Measurement 都有大小，不约束无关 Quantity，不合并行，也不认证框架的实际适用性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeContextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A selected gram-count Quantity with no quantityValue or hasReferenceFrame violates this context condition; an unrelated weight Quantity is outside its guard."
msgstr "选定的 n-gram 位置计数 Quantity 若缺少 quantityValue 或 hasReferenceFrame，就违反此上下文条件；无关权重 Quantity 不在其前置条件的范围内。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeContextConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to require explicit context for an actual count supplied through ngramSize."
msgstr "用于要求通过 ngramSize 提供的实际计数具有显式上下文。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeContextConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a frame edge as proof of historical segmentation, inventing a default frame, demanding one keyword row globally or replacing the separate weight result."
msgstr "避免将框架边当作历史切分的证明、虚构默认框架、要求全局只有一条关键词行，或替换独立的权重结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeContextConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind each count through ngramSize; require quantityValue, math:dimensionless and hasReferenceFrame. Compare every dimension by complete RDF identity and every pair of magnitudes by numeric equality, retaining distinct source rows and conventions."
msgstr "通过 ngramSize 绑定每个计数；要求 quantityValue、math:dimensionless 和 hasReferenceFrame。按完整 RDF 身份比较每个维度，按数值相等比较每对数值，保留不同来源行和约定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "n-gram size value constraint"
msgstr "n-gram 大小数值约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every magnitude of every Quantity selected by ngramSize is a valid finite RDF integer-family literal whose numeric value is strictly greater than zero."
msgstr "由 ngramSize 选定的每个 Quantity 的所有数值都必须是有效且有限的 RDF 整数族字面量，其数值严格大于零。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Datatype-component identity, shared numeric lexical/value admission and strict positivity are all required. Every supplied magnitude is checked with its original lexical form and datatype, without coercion."
msgstr "数据类型分量身份、共享的数值词法与值准入以及严格正值都不可缺少。每个已提供数值都以其原始词法形式和数据类型接受检查，不作强制转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A valid positive xsd:integer is admitted without retyping. Zero, negative zero, negative sentinels, malformed integers and decimal or floating literals do not satisfy this count condition."
msgstr "有效的正 xsd:integer 无需重新标注类型即可准入。零、负零、负哨兵值、格式错误的整数以及十进制或浮点字面量均不满足此计数条件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeValueConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to validate actual positive gram counts while retaining supplied RDF integer-family representations."
msgstr "用于验证实际的 n-gram 正整数位置计数，同时保留所提供的 RDF 整数族表示。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeValueConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting numeric-looking strings, decimals, floats, nonfinite values or sentinels as counts, checking only one of several magnitudes or normalizing a rejected value into apparent validity."
msgstr "避免把看似数字的字符串、十进制数、浮点数、非有限值或哨兵值当作计数，避免只检查多个数值中的一个，或通过规范化使被拒绝的值显得有效。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/NgramSizeValueConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind every quantityValue through its selected ngramSize Quantity. Require termIsFiniteNumeric, the exact datatype-component disjunction for thirteen XSD integer-family datatypes, and termGreater against typed integer zero. Keep presence and frame in the separate context law."
msgstr "通过 ngramSize 选定的 Quantity 绑定每个 quantityValue。要求 termIsFiniteNumeric、十三种 XSD 整数族数据类型的精确类型分量析取，以及相对于带整数类型的零的 termGreater 比较。存在性和框架义务由独立的上下文规则承担。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockHtml|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported block HTML"
msgstr "报告的内容块 HTML"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockHtml|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The HTML source string reported for this ContentBlock in an extraction or source-presentation context."
msgstr "在抽取或源内容呈现语境中为此 ContentBlock 报告的 HTML 源字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockHtml|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional field retains markup as xsd:string. It asserts no parsed DOM, Rendering, sanitization or execution, and does not redefine the block’s structural identity."
msgstr "此字段可省略且不具有函数性，以 xsd:string 保留标记文本。它不断言已解析的 DOM、Rendering、净化或执行，也不重新定义内容块的结构身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockHtml|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional extraction reports the exact string `<p>Amber</p>` for a paragraph block."
msgstr "一个虚构抽取过程为某段落内容块报告原样字符串 `<p>Amber</p>`。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockHtml|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when an extraction or source-presentation report supplies HTML text for an actual ContentBlock."
msgstr "当抽取或源内容呈现报告为实际 ContentBlock 提供 HTML 文本时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockHtml|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring HTML from plain text, constructing a Rendering merely to hold markup, or treating reported markup as safe to execute."
msgstr "避免从纯文本推断 HTML、仅为承载标记文本而构造 Rendering，或将报告的标记文本视为可安全执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockHtml|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied xsd:string unchanged on the ContentBlock, including blank strings, and retain the assertion’s actual source and viewpoint. Leave unavailable HTML absent."
msgstr "在 ContentBlock 上原样保留所提供的 xsd:string，包括空字符串，并保留断言的实际来源和视角。未提供 HTML 时省略该字段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionTag|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported chunk section tag"
msgstr "报告的分块节标签"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionTag|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The section-tag string reported by the chunker for this Chunk."
msgstr "分块器为此 Chunk 报告的节标签字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionTag|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional xsd:string retains a source descriptor. It establishes no controlled tag identity, document hierarchy, heading level or source position."
msgstr "此 xsd:string 字段可省略且不具有函数性，用于保留源描述符。它不确立受控标签身份、文档层级、标题级别或源位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionTag|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional chunker reports the section tag opening for one Chunk."
msgstr "一个虚构分块器为某个 Chunk 报告节标签 opening。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionTag|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a chunker report supplies a section-tag string for an actual Chunk."
msgstr "当分块器报告为实际 Chunk 提供节标签字符串时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionTag|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid converting the string to a token, a Tag individual, a structural segment type or an inferred heading level."
msgstr "避免将字符串转换为 token、Tag 个体、结构片段类型或推断的标题级别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionTag|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact xsd:string on the Chunk with its actual attribution. Preserve blank strings and leave missing tags absent without inventing defaults."
msgstr "在 Chunk 上保留原样 xsd:string 及其实际归属信息。保留空字符串；缺少标签时省略，不编造默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkChapterHeading|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported chunk chapter heading"
msgstr "报告的分块章标题"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkChapterHeading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The chapter-heading wording reported by the chunker for this Chunk."
msgstr "分块器为此 Chunk 报告的章标题文字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkChapterHeading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional wording preserves language and direction when supplied. Its role does not establish a chapter entity, nesting, heading depth or membership in a division."
msgstr "此文字字段可省略且不具有函数性，保留实际提供的语言和方向。其角色不确立章实体、嵌套关系、标题深度或所属篇章。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkChapterHeading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional chunker reports the chapter heading Amber coast for one Chunk."
msgstr "一个虚构分块器为某个 Chunk 报告章标题 Amber coast。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkChapterHeading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a chunker report supplies wording in the chapter-heading role for an actual Chunk."
msgstr "当分块器报告为实际 Chunk 提供章标题角色的文字时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkChapterHeading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid guessing a chapter from another heading, using this wording as a chapter identifier or inferring document structure from its presence."
msgstr "避免从其他标题猜测章、将此文字作为章标识符，或因其存在而推断文档结构。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkChapterHeading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the complete supplied word literal on the Chunk with its actual language, direction and attribution. Preserve blank strings; leave an unavailable chapter heading absent."
msgstr "在 Chunk 上保留所提供的完整文字字面量及其实际语言、方向和归属信息。保留空字符串；未提供章标题时省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionHeading|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported chunk section heading"
msgstr "报告的分块节标题"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionHeading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The section-heading wording reported by the chunker for this Chunk."
msgstr "分块器为此 Chunk 报告的节标题文字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionHeading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional wording preserves language and direction when supplied. It is distinct from the section tag and does not establish a structural section, heading level or containing chapter."
msgstr "此文字字段可省略且不具有函数性，保留实际提供的语言和方向。它与节标签不同，不确立结构性节、标题级别或所属章。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionHeading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional chunker reports the section heading Tidal garden for one Chunk."
msgstr "一个虚构分块器为某个 Chunk 报告节标题 Tidal garden。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionHeading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a chunker report supplies wording in the section-heading role for an actual Chunk."
msgstr "当分块器报告为实际 Chunk 提供节标题角色的文字时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionHeading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting the section tag for the heading, inventing a missing chapter heading or treating equal wording as shared section identity."
msgstr "避免用节标签代替标题、编造缺失的章标题，或将相同文字视为同一节身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSectionHeading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the complete supplied word literal on the Chunk with its actual language, direction and attribution. Preserve blank strings; leave an unavailable section heading absent."
msgstr "在 Chunk 上保留所提供的完整文字字面量及其实际语言、方向和归属信息。保留空字符串；未提供节标题时省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSubsectionHeading|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported chunk subsection heading"
msgstr "报告的分块小节标题"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSubsectionHeading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The subsection-heading wording reported by the chunker for this Chunk."
msgstr "分块器为此 Chunk 报告的小节标题文字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSubsectionHeading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional wording preserves language and direction when supplied. Its role does not establish a subsection entity, structural nesting or any particular numeric heading level."
msgstr "此文字字段可省略且不具有函数性，保留实际提供的语言和方向。其角色不确立小节实体、结构嵌套或任何特定的数字标题级别。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSubsectionHeading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional chunker reports the subsection heading Quiet pools for one Chunk."
msgstr "一个虚构分块器为某个 Chunk 报告小节标题 Quiet pools。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSubsectionHeading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a chunker report supplies wording in the subsection-heading role for an actual Chunk."
msgstr "当分块器报告为实际 Chunk 提供小节标题角色的文字时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSubsectionHeading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving this heading from indentation, fabricating its parent headings or converting the role into a numeric document depth."
msgstr "避免从缩进推导此标题、编造其父标题，或将此角色转换为数字文档深度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkSubsectionHeading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the complete supplied word literal on the Chunk with its actual language, direction and attribution. Preserve blank strings; leave an unavailable subsection heading absent."
msgstr "在 Chunk 上保留所提供的完整文字字面量及其实际语言、方向和归属信息。保留空字符串；未提供小节标题时省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkMarkerLines|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported chunk marker lines"
msgstr "报告的分块标记行"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkMarkerLines|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An ordered sequence of marker-line strings reported by the chunker for this Chunk."
msgstr "分块器为此 Chunk 报告的标记行字符串有序序列。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkMarkerLines|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional relation selects a StructuredSequence of distinct scalar string occurrences. Repetition, order and blank strings remain intact. An explicitly supplied empty sequence differs from omission; a schema default alone proves no historical presence."
msgstr "此关系可省略且不具有函数性，选择由独立标量字符串出现项构成的 StructuredSequence。保留重复、顺序和空字符串。明确提供的空序列不同于省略；仅有模式默认值不能证明历史上实际提供过该字段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkMarkerLines|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional report supplies two marker occurrences containing the same string, followed by a blank marker occurrence."
msgstr "一个虚构报告提供两个内容相同的标记出现项，随后提供一个空标记出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkMarkerLines|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when an actual source report supplies an ordered marker-line sequence for a Chunk, including an explicitly supplied empty sequence."
msgstr "当实际源报告为 Chunk 提供有序标记行序列时使用，包括明确提供的空序列。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkMarkerLines|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid collapsing repeated strings, sorting markers, splitting a string at newlines, admitting maps or null items, or inferring field presence from a schema default."
msgstr "避免合并重复字符串、对标记排序、按换行拆分字符串、接纳映射或空值项，或从模式默认值推断字段存在。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/chunkMarkerLines|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link each supplied sequence to the Chunk. Retain each item as a distinct StructuredValue with its exact xsd:string structuredTerm and zero-based entryOrdinal. Assert an empty sequence only with actual supplied evidence, and retain attribution."
msgstr "将每个实际提供的序列关联到 Chunk。将每项保留为独立 StructuredValue，并保留其原样 xsd:string structuredTerm 和从零开始的 entryOrdinal。仅在有实际提供的证据时断言空序列，并保留归属信息。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkMarkerLineTextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported chunk marker string constraint"
msgstr "报告的分块标记字符串约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkMarkerLineTextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every item in a sequence selected by chunkMarkerLines has a structuredTerm, and every such term has exactly the xsd:string datatype."
msgstr "chunkMarkerLines 所选择序列的每个项都具有 structuredTerm，且每个这样的项值都恰好具有 xsd:string 数据类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkMarkerLineTextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This role-scoped constraint reuses the generic scalar-branch, whole-term identity and ordinal laws. An empty selected sequence is valid. It adds no required marker relation and changes no generic structured-value contract."
msgstr "此约束仅适用于该角色，复用通用标量分支、完整项身份和序位规则。所选序列为空时有效。它不要求必须存在标记关系，也不改变通用结构化值契约。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkMarkerLineTextConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A selected sequence item with a blank xsd:string term is valid; an item with no term or a language-tagged term fails this constraint."
msgstr "所选序列项包含空 xsd:string 项值时有效；缺少项值或项值带语言标签时违反此约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkMarkerLineTextConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to validate the scalar string payload of each supplied chunk marker occurrence."
msgstr "用于验证每个实际提供的分块标记出现项的标量字符串载荷。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkMarkerLineTextConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid accepting malformed items by coercing terms, omitting bad values or replacing a missing term with an empty string."
msgstr "避免通过强制转换项值、丢弃错误值或以空字符串替代缺失项值来接纳格式错误的项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ChunkMarkerLineTextConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Follow chunkMarkerLines and structuredItem. Require a structuredTerm for every selected item, then compare every supplied term’s datatype component with xsd:string through termSameComponent. Report failures without rewriting the source."
msgstr "沿 chunkMarkerLines 和 structuredItem 遍历。要求每个所选项具有 structuredTerm，然后通过 termSameComponent 将每个实际提供项值的数据类型分量与 xsd:string 比较。报告失败，不改写源内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MathematicalExpressionFinding|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "mathematical expression finding"
msgstr "数学表达式发现记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MathematicalExpressionFinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An Observation retaining one pass’s reported mathematical-expression occurrence in an actual ContentBlock, with supplied LaTeX wording and displayed status."
msgstr "一种 Observation，保留某次处理遍次在实际 ContentBlock 中报告的一个数学表达式出现项，以及已提供的 LaTeX 文字和展示状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MathematicalExpressionFinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This finding is neither a mathematical syntax tree nor a Rendering. It requires exactly one actual block, one string and one boolean, an actual method and at least one supplied vantage; raw pass confidence is optional."
msgstr "此记录既不是数学语法树，也不是 Rendering。它必须具有且仅具有一个实际块、一个字符串和一个布尔值，并具有实际方法和至少一个已提供视角；处理遍次的原始置信值可省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MathematicalExpressionFinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional pass supplies `ex:finding a gmeow:MathematicalExpressionFinding .` about its actual block."
msgstr "一个虚构处理遍次为其实际块提供 `ex:finding a gmeow:MathematicalExpressionFinding .`。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MathematicalExpressionFinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a source reports a mathematical-expression occurrence and supplies its block, LaTeX string, displayed boolean, method and vantage."
msgstr "当来源报告一个数学表达式出现项，并提供其块、LaTeX 字符串、展示布尔值、方法和视角时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MathematicalExpressionFinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid merging findings from different passes, interpreting LaTeX as a Math AST, or inventing an Agent, invocation, model revision or time."
msgstr "避免合并不同处理遍次的发现记录、将 LaTeX 解释为 Math AST，或编造 Agent、调用、模型修订版或时间。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MathematicalExpressionFinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep a distinct finding for each supplied occurrence and pass. Bind observedFeature to its actual ContentBlock, observationMethod to HOW and vantage to the actual supplied WHO or standpoint context; retain joint vantages."
msgstr "为每个已提供出现项及其处理遍次保留独立发现记录。将 observedFeature 关联到其实际 ContentBlock，将 observationMethod 关联到方法，将 vantage 关联到实际提供的主体或立场语境；保留共同视角。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingLatex|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "expression finding LaTeX"
msgstr "表达式发现记录的 LaTeX"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingLatex|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact xsd:string LaTeX wording supplied for this mathematical-expression finding, including a blank string."
msgstr "为此数学表达式发现记录提供的精确 xsd:string 类型 LaTeX 文字，包括空字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingLatex|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Exactly one value is required per finding. This literal carrier neither parses nor repairs the wording and does not create a mathematical expression object."
msgstr "每个发现记录必须具有且仅具有一个值。此字面量载体不解析或修复文字，也不创建数学表达式对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingLatex|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional finding retains `ex:finding gmeow:expressionFindingLatex \"\" .` when a blank string was supplied."
msgstr "当已提供空字符串时，虚构发现记录保留 `ex:finding gmeow:expressionFindingLatex \"\" .`。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingLatex|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to preserve the supplied LaTeX string of a mathematical-expression finding."
msgstr "用于保留数学表达式发现记录中已提供的 LaTeX 字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingLatex|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid dropping blank strings, adding language tags, normalizing notation or treating matching strings as finding identity."
msgstr "避免丢弃空字符串、添加语言标签、规范化记法，或因字符串相同而认定发现记录相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingLatex|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Copy the supplied xsd:string through this specialization of lang:literalValue and attribute that exact statement to its actual source."
msgstr "通过此 lang:literalValue 的专门化属性复制已提供的 xsd:string，并将该精确陈述归属于其实际来源。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingDisplayed|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "expression finding displayed status"
msgstr "表达式发现记录的展示状态"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingDisplayed|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The xsd:boolean displayed-math status supplied for this mathematical-expression finding."
msgstr "为此数学表达式发现记录提供的 xsd:boolean 类型独立展示公式状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingDisplayed|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Exactly one value is required, including false when supplied. This status has no default and does not determine truth, correctness or general displayability."
msgstr "必须具有且仅具有一个值，包括已提供的 false。此状态没有默认值，也不决定真值、正确性或一般显示资格。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingDisplayed|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional pass supplies `ex:finding gmeow:expressionFindingDisplayed false .`"
msgstr "一个虚构处理遍次提供 `ex:finding gmeow:expressionFindingDisplayed false .`。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingDisplayed|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to retain the actual displayed boolean reported for a mathematical-expression occurrence."
msgstr "用于保留数学表达式出现项实际报告的展示布尔值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingDisplayed|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid coercing strings or numbers to booleans, replacing false with absence or guessing a value from layout or LaTeX delimiters."
msgstr "避免将字符串或数字强制转换为布尔值、将 false 替换为缺失，或从布局或 LaTeX 分隔符猜测值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingDisplayed|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the supplied xsd:boolean unchanged. Missing or invalid selected input fails the finding contract without a synthesized default."
msgstr "原样保留已提供的 xsd:boolean。所选输入缺失或无效时，发现记录契约失败，不合成默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingPassConfidence|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "expression finding raw pass confidence"
msgstr "表达式发现记录的处理遍次原始置信值"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingPassConfidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The raw xsd:decimal confidence value supplied by the pass for this mathematical-expression finding."
msgstr "处理遍次为此数学表达式发现记录提供的 xsd:decimal 类型原始置信值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingPassConfidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Optional and locally at most one; zero differs from absence. No bounds, probability, calibration, unit, frame, credence or decision semantics are established."
msgstr "此值可省略，且在记录内至多一个；零不同于缺失。不确立界限、概率、校准、单位、参照系、信念程度或决策语义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingPassConfidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional pass retains `ex:finding gmeow:expressionFindingPassConfidence \"0\"^^xsd:decimal .`"
msgstr "一个虚构处理遍次保留 `ex:finding gmeow:expressionFindingPassConfidence \"0\"^^xsd:decimal .`。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingPassConfidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use only when the pass supplies a valid raw decimal confidence value for this finding."
msgstr "仅当处理遍次为此发现记录提供有效的原始十进制置信值时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingPassConfidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring probability, normalizing, bounding, filling an absent value with zero or substituting a value for invalid decimal input."
msgstr "避免推断概率、规范化、限定范围、以零填补缺失值，或为无效十进制输入替换一个值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/expressionFindingPassConfidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain a supplied valid xsd:decimal or omit an absent value. Invalid selected decimal input fails; NaN and INF have no decimal representation and never become zero."
msgstr "保留已提供的有效 xsd:decimal，缺失时省略。所选十进制输入无效时失败；NaN 和 INF 没有十进制表示，绝不转换为零。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockExpressionFindings|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "block expression findings"
msgstr "块的表达式发现记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockExpressionFindings|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates an actual ContentBlock to a source-supplied StructuredSequence of mathematical-expression finding occurrences."
msgstr "将实际 ContentBlock 关联到来源提供的数学表达式发现记录出现项 StructuredSequence。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockExpressionFindings|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional nonfunctional relation permits independent source rosters to coexist. An explicitly supplied empty roster differs from a missing roster; no universal list or historical presence is inferred."
msgstr "此关系可省略且不具有函数性，允许不同来源的列表并存。明确提供的空列表不同于缺失列表；不推断统一列表或历史存在性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockExpressionFindings|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional source supplies `ex:block gmeow:blockExpressionFindings ex:roster .`"
msgstr "一个虚构来源提供 `ex:block gmeow:blockExpressionFindings ex:roster .`。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockExpressionFindings|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a source actually supplies an ordered finding roster for a block, including an explicit empty roster."
msgstr "当来源实际为块提供有序发现记录列表时使用，包括明确提供的空列表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockExpressionFindings|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deduplication, sorting, unioning independent rosters, deriving presence from defaults or inferring provenance on findings from this link."
msgstr "避免去重、排序、合并独立列表、从默认值推断存在性，或从此关联推断发现记录的溯源信息。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/blockExpressionFindings|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep distinct scalar StructuredValue items with entryOrdinal and structuredTerm pointing to actual finding resources. Retain order, repetition and exact-statement attribution separately for each roster and finding."
msgstr "保留独立的标量 StructuredValue 项，使用 entryOrdinal 和指向实际发现记录资源的 structuredTerm。分别为每个列表和发现记录保留顺序、重复以及精确陈述的归属信息。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExpressionFindingSequenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "block expression finding sequence constraint"
msgstr "块表达式发现记录序列约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExpressionFindingSequenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every item selected through blockExpressionFindings has a structuredTerm; every supplied term is typed MathematicalExpressionFinding and has the roster’s actual block as observedFeature."
msgstr "通过 blockExpressionFindings 选取的每项都具有 structuredTerm；每个已提供项值的类型都是 MathematicalExpressionFinding，且其 observedFeature 是列表对应的实际块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExpressionFindingSequenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This scoped law requires scalar finding payloads and block agreement, alongside the generic branch and ordering laws and the finding’s exact-one feature law. Explicit empty rosters remain valid."
msgstr "此局部规则要求标量发现记录载荷及块的一致性，并与通用分支和顺序规则、发现记录有且仅有一个特征的规则共同适用。明确的空列表仍有效。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExpressionFindingSequenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An item with a valid finding and an extra untyped term fails; a good payload never hides a bad extra payload."
msgstr "具有有效发现记录以及额外未定类型项值的项违反规则；有效载荷绝不掩盖额外的无效载荷。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExpressionFindingSequenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to validate every occurrence in each actually supplied block finding roster."
msgstr "用于验证每份实际提供的块发现记录列表中的每个出现项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExpressionFindingSequenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid skipping missing terms, extra bad terms or wrong-block findings, or manufacturing a finding to repair a malformed roster."
msgstr "避免跳过缺失项值、额外无效项值或指向错误块的发现记录，或编造发现记录以修复格式错误的列表。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/BlockExpressionFindingSequenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Follow blockExpressionFindings and structuredItem. Require a scalar payload, check every supplied term’s finding type and observedFeature agreement, and report failure without substitution."
msgstr "沿 blockExpressionFindings 和 structuredItem 遍历。要求标量载荷，检查每个已提供项值的发现记录类型及 observedFeature 一致性，并报告失败，不替换项值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysis|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "image analysis"
msgstr "图像分析"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysis|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An Observation retaining one coherent supplied analysis of an actual stored MediaObject through reported category, description or passage-boundary readings."
msgstr "一种 Observation，通过报告的类别、描述或文段边界读数，保留对实际存储 MediaObject 的一次内容一致的已提供分析。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysis|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Each analysis requires one actual media feature, one method, at least one supplied vantage and at least one reported field. Shared media or a coarse stage label establishes no shared invocation, report or model revision."
msgstr "每个分析要求一个实际媒体特征、一个方法、至少一个已提供视角以及至少一个报告字段。共享媒体或粗粒度阶段标签不确立共同调用、报告或模型修订版。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysis|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional report supplies `ex:analysis a gmeow:ImageAnalysis .` for its actual stored image and supplied analysis context."
msgstr "一个虚构报告为其实际存储图像及已提供分析语境提供 `ex:analysis a gmeow:ImageAnalysis .`。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysis|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when at least one image reading and an actual coherent analysis context, media target, method and vantage are supplied."
msgstr "当提供至少一个图像读数，以及实际一致的分析语境、媒体目标、方法和视角时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysis|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid creating an analysis from all missing defaults, merging independent readings or inventing an Agent, run, model revision, time or depicted Scene."
msgstr "避免从全部缺失的默认值创建分析、合并独立读数，或编造 Agent、运行、模型修订版、时间或被描绘的 Scene。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysis|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind observedFeature to the actual stored MediaObject, observationMethod to supplied HOW and vantage to actual WHO or standpoint. Keep coherent fields together only with supplied context and attribute each actual statement separately."
msgstr "将 observedFeature 关联到实际存储的 MediaObject，将 observationMethod 关联到已提供方法，将 vantage 关联到实际主体或立场。仅在有已提供语境时汇集一致字段，并分别记录每条实际陈述的归属信息。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisCategory|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported image-analysis category"
msgstr "报告的图像分析类别"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisCategory|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The category wording supplied by this image analysis for its actual media feature."
msgstr "此图像分析为其实际媒体特征提供的类别文字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisCategory|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, locally single-valued word literal retains a reported label, not an enum member, canonical type, depicted entity or verified image classification."
msgstr "此文字字面量可省略，在分析内至多取一个值，保留报告的标签，不表示枚举成员、规范类型、被描绘实体或已验证的图像分类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisCategory|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional report retains `ex:analysis gmeow:imageAnalysisCategory \"diagram\" .` as untagged supplied wording."
msgstr "一个虚构报告将 `ex:analysis gmeow:imageAnalysisCategory \"diagram\" .` 保留为未标注语言的已提供文字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisCategory|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the actual analysis supplies category wording, including a blank string."
msgstr "当实际分析提供类别文字时使用，包括空字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisCategory|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid turning the label into rdf:type, a controlled category, a depiction or a preferred classification, or adding an invented language tag."
msgstr "避免将标签转化为 rdf:type、受控类别、描绘关系或首选分类，或添加编造的语言标签。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisCategory|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep one complete supplied word literal through lang:literalValue, preserving actual language, direction and blank text. Retain exact-statement attribution and leave missing wording absent."
msgstr "通过 lang:literalValue 保留一个完整的已提供文字字面量，保留实际语言、方向和空文本。保留精确陈述的归属信息；缺少文字时省略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisDescription|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported image-analysis description"
msgstr "报告的图像分析描述"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisDescription|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The image-description wording supplied by this image analysis for its actual media feature."
msgstr "此图像分析为其实际媒体特征提供的图像描述文字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisDescription|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, locally single-valued word literal retains reported image commentary. It is not a generic description of the analysis process, an asserted Scene or proof that its content is true."
msgstr "此文字字面量可省略，在分析内至多取一个值，保留报告的图像评论。它不是对分析过程的一般描述、已断言的 Scene，也不是其内容真实的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisDescription|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional report retains `ex:analysis gmeow:imageAnalysisDescription \"\" .` because it explicitly supplied blank description text."
msgstr "一个虚构报告保留 `ex:analysis gmeow:imageAnalysisDescription \"\" .`，因为其明确提供了空描述文本。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisDescription|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when an actual image analysis supplies its own descriptive wording, with or without a supplied language tag."
msgstr "当实际图像分析提供其自身描述文字时使用，无论是否实际提供语言标签。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisDescription|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid trimming away blank text, hardcoding English, endorsing the description or moving it onto the media as an unattributed global fact."
msgstr "避免通过裁剪丢弃空文本、硬编码英语、认可描述，或将描述移到媒体上作为没有归属信息的全局事实。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisDescription|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Preserve one complete supplied word literal through lang:literalValue with its actual language, direction and attribution. Keep independent descriptions on their own coherent analyses."
msgstr "通过 lang:literalValue 保留一个完整的已提供文字字面量及其实际语言、方向和归属信息。独立描述保留在各自内容一致的分析上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisPassageBoundary|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reported image passage-boundary flag"
msgstr "报告的图像文段边界标志"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisPassageBoundary|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The xsd:boolean supplied by this image analysis to report whether its media marks a passage boundary."
msgstr "此图像分析提供的 xsd:boolean，用于报告其媒体是否标记文段边界。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisPassageBoundary|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional flag is locally at most one. Supplied false remains a value; absence remains unknown. No default, structural division, boundary coordinate or actual segmentation is inferred."
msgstr "此标志可省略，在分析内至多取一个值。已提供的 false 仍是一个值；缺失保持未知。不推断默认值、结构篇章、边界坐标或实际分段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisPassageBoundary|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A fictional report supplies `ex:analysis gmeow:imageAnalysisPassageBoundary false .`"
msgstr "一个虚构报告提供 `ex:analysis gmeow:imageAnalysisPassageBoundary false .`。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisPassageBoundary|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the actual analysis explicitly supplies its passage-boundary boolean, including false."
msgstr "当实际分析明确提供其文段边界布尔值时使用，包括 false。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisPassageBoundary|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid replacing false with absence, coercing text or numbers to booleans, or deriving a boundary from category, description or missing output."
msgstr "避免将 false 替换为缺失、将文本或数值强制转换为布尔值，或从类别、描述或缺失输出推导边界。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/imageAnalysisPassageBoundary|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied xsd:boolean unchanged on its actual ImageAnalysis and attribute the exact statement. Omit an unavailable flag without synthesizing false or an analysis record."
msgstr "在其实际 ImageAnalysis 上原样保留已提供的 xsd:boolean，并记录精确陈述的归属信息。未提供标志时省略，不合成 false 或分析记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysisReportedContentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "image-analysis reported-content constraint"
msgstr "图像分析报告内容约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysisReportedContentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every ImageAnalysis has at least one supplied category, description or passage-boundary value."
msgstr "每个 ImageAnalysis 至少具有一个已提供的类别、描述或文段边界值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysisReportedContentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The three roles remain independently optional, but an analysis cannot consist only of missing defaults. Blank wording and false satisfy presence; separate datatype, cardinality and context laws still apply."
msgstr "三个角色各自仍可省略，但分析不能仅由缺失的默认值构成。空文字和 false 满足存在性要求；独立的数据类型、基数和语境规则仍适用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysisReportedContentConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An analysis with only `ex:analysis gmeow:imageAnalysisPassageBoundary false .` as its reported field satisfies this presence law."
msgstr "分析仅以 `ex:analysis gmeow:imageAnalysisPassageBoundary false .` 作为报告字段时，满足此存在性规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysisReportedContentConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to require an actual reported reading before a complete image-analysis record is asserted."
msgstr "用于在断言完整图像分析记录之前要求存在实际报告的读数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysisReportedContentConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating default absence as an analysis, discarding blank or false values, or assuming this law establishes a common invocation for independently supplied fields."
msgstr "避免将默认缺失视为分析、丢弃空值或 false，或假定此规则为独立提供的字段确立共同调用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ImageAnalysisReportedContentConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Check each ImageAnalysis for existence of at least one of the three field relations. Preserve the actual coherent context and enforce the separate value-type, feature, method and vantage obligations."
msgstr "检查每个 ImageAnalysis 是否至少存在三个字段关系之一。保留实际一致的语境，并执行独立的值类型、特征、方法和视角义务。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelExecutionIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "model execution identity"
msgstr "模型执行标识"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelExecutionIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The BLAKE3 execution-identity digest supplied by a provider’s inference receipt for this ModelInvocation, retained as carried under the receipt’s actual scheme for the weights, quantization and runtime configuration or build of that call."
msgstr "提供者的推理回执为本次 ModelInvocation 提供的 BLAKE3 执行标识摘要；依照回执针对该调用的权重、量化及运行时配置或构建版本所采用的实际方案，按原样保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelExecutionIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This optional, nonfunctional role records the provider’s reported execution identity. It does not certify complete capture of the execution context, verified digest agreement or deterministic equivalence of calls, outputs or model agents."
msgstr "此角色可选且非函数式，记录提供者报告的执行标识。它不认证执行语境已被完整记录、摘要一致性已被验证，也不认证调用、输出或模型代理之间的确定性等价。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelExecutionIdentity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A provider’s receipt reports the execution identity of one call with its weights, quantization and runtime-build context; the invocation retains the supplied BLAKE3 digest and that receipt context."
msgstr "提供者的回执报告某次调用的执行标识及其权重、量化和运行时构建语境；调用记录保留来源提供的 BLAKE3 摘要和该回执语境。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelExecutionIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the provider’s actual inference receipt supplies a BLAKE3 execution identity for a particular generative call, beyond the requested alias or model name."
msgstr "用于提供者的实际推理回执为某次特定生成式调用提供 BLAKE3 执行标识，而非仅提供请求别名或模型名称时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelExecutionIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid substituting modelRevision, modelIdentifier, modelAlias or an artifact’s contentDigest, guessing BLAKE3 mode, output length, fixed case or preimage encoding, or retyping the supplied value to a narrower named digest datatype."
msgstr "避免以 modelRevision、modelIdentifier、modelAlias 或某制品的 contentDigest 替代，猜测 BLAKE3 模式、输出长度、固定大小写或原像编码，或将提供值改成更窄的具名摘要数据类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modelExecutionIdentity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied xsd:hexBinary lexical form and datatype on the ModelInvocation. Preserve the provider receipt, source attribution and its actual weights, quantization and runtime context without inventing missing fields. Do not infer cross-scheme identity, hash verification or a whole weights-byte preimage from the digest alone."
msgstr "在 ModelInvocation 上保留来源提供的 xsd:hexBinary 词法形式和数据类型。保留提供者回执、来源归属及其实际权重、量化和运行时语境，不编造缺失字段。不得仅凭摘要推断跨方案身份相同、哈希已验证，或原像为全部权重字节。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ExtractionReclassificationReading|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Extraction reclassification reading"
msgstr "提取重分类解读"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ExtractionReclassificationReading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A Refinement retaining one extraction pass's reported prior and resulting ContentSegmentType identities for an actual ContentBlock, separately from the block's structural segmentType."
msgstr "为实际 ContentBlock 保留一次提取过程所报先前及结果 ContentSegmentType 身份的 Refinement，与块本身的结构性 segmentType 分开。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ExtractionReclassificationReading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "One actual block, prior kind, resulting kind and method are required, with at least one real source and supplied vantage. Joint vantages coexist. Outcome, input scope and raw pass confidence are optional; no current global kind, chronology or successful execution is inferred."
msgstr "必须有一个实际块、先前类型、结果类型和方法，以及至少一个真实来源和所提供视角。联合视角可以共存。定性结果、输入范围及过程原始置信数值可省略；不推断全局当前类型、时序或成功执行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ExtractionReclassificationReading|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A source-recorded extraction pass retains its actual prior and resulting kind identities on a separate reading while the original block and competing readings remain unchanged."
msgstr "来源记录的提取过程在独立解读上保留实际先前及结果类型身份，原始块与其他并存解读保持不变。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ExtractionReclassificationReading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when actual block, kind identities, method, source derivation and named versioned process or standpoint context are supplied for an extraction reclassification reading."
msgstr "用于提取重分类解读确实提供实际块、类型身份、方法、来源派生，以及具名版本化过程或立场上下文的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ExtractionReclassificationReading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid resolving a label into a kind identity, overwriting segmentType, requiring the prior and resulting identities to differ, inventing a model run, or defaulting an absent outcome, scope or chronology."
msgstr "避免将标签解析成类型身份、覆盖 segmentType、要求先前与结果身份不同、虚构模型运行，或为缺失的定性结果、范围或时序填入默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ExtractionReclassificationReading|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind observedFeature to the actual ContentBlock, reclassifiedFrom to the reported prior kind and observationResult to the supplied resulting kind. Retain the actual source records through wasDerivedFrom, HOW through observationMethod and actual versioned WHO or standpoint context through vantage; preserve exact-statement attribution separately."
msgstr "将 observedFeature 关联到实际 ContentBlock，将 reclassifiedFrom 关联到所报先前类型，将 observationResult 关联到所提供结果类型。通过 wasDerivedFrom 保留真实来源记录，通过 observationMethod 保留方法，通过 vantage 保留实际版本化过程主体或立场上下文；分别保留各具体断言的归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassifiedFrom|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reclassified from"
msgstr "所报先前类型"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassifiedFrom|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The actual ContentSegmentType identity reported as the prior kind in an ExtractionReclassificationReading, rather than a mutable kind field on its ContentBlock."
msgstr "ExtractionReclassificationReading 中报告为先前类型的实际 ContentSegmentType 身份，而不是其 ContentBlock 上可变的类型字段。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassifiedFrom|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Exactly one prior identity is required per coherent reading. Its label spelling establishes no identity, historical chronology, difference from the resulting kind or globally preferred interpretation. This relation does not specialize segmentType."
msgstr "每个完整一致解读恰好需要一个先前类型身份。标签拼写不确立身份、历史时序、与结果类型的差异或全局优先解释。此关系不特化 segmentType。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassifiedFrom|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An attributed reading names the prior kind actually supplied by its source without changing the block's structural type or resolving an unresolved source label."
msgstr "带归属的解读命名来源实际提供的先前类型，不改变块的结构类型，也不解析尚未确定身份的来源标签。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassifiedFrom|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the source-supported prior kind identity of an extraction reclassification reading."
msgstr "用于提取重分类解读中由来源支持的先前类型身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassifiedFrom|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid guessing a prior kind from current segmentType, a stage name or matching text, minting a kind to repair a missing identity, or asserting that an earlier reading was false."
msgstr "避免从当前 segmentType、阶段名称或相同文字猜测先前类型，避免为补足缺失身份而创建类型，也不要断言较早解读为假。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassifiedFrom|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the actual ContentSegmentType individual on the reading and retain the supplied resulting kind through existing observationResult. Preserve unresolved raw labels in the source record instead of silently converting them to vocabulary identities."
msgstr "在解读上保留实际 ContentSegmentType 个体，通过现有 observationResult 保留所提供结果类型。将未解析的原始标签保留在来源记录中，不静默转换为词汇身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassificationPassConfidence|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reclassification raw pass confidence"
msgstr "重分类过程原始置信数值"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassificationPassConfidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The supplied raw pass-confidence math:Quantity of an ExtractionReclassificationReading, preserving its original finite numeric magnitudes and actual declared dimension and frame interpretation."
msgstr "ExtractionReclassificationReading 所提供的过程原始置信数值 math:Quantity，保留原始有限数值及实际声明的维度和参考系解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassificationPassConfidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Optional and at most one Quantity per coherent reading. A supplied zero, negative value or value above one is retained when valid and finite; absence is not zero. No source numeric datatype, dimensionless dimension, bounds, probability, calibration or confidence conversion is inferred."
msgstr "此项可省略，每个完整一致解读至多关联一个 Quantity。提供的零、负值或大于一的值只要有效有限就予以保留；缺失不是零。不推断来源数值类型、无量纲维度、范围、概率、校准或置信度转换。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassificationPassConfidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A pass's supplied raw score retains its original numeric literal and actual interpretation; no score is fabricated for a reading that supplied none."
msgstr "过程提供的原始分数保留其原始数值字面量及实际解释；解读未提供分数时不补造分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassificationPassConfidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use only when the pass supplies an original valid finite numeric confidence value with its actual mathematical dimension and frame interpretation."
msgstr "仅用于过程提供原始有效有限置信数值及其实际数学维度和参考系解释的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassificationPassConfidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reusing bounded statement confidence, classifierScore or expressionFindingPassConfidence, guessing xsd:decimal, clamping values, substituting zero or inventing dimensions and frames to hide incomplete interpretation."
msgstr "避免复用有界语句置信度、classifierScore 或 expressionFindingPassConfidence，避免猜定 xsd:decimal、截断数值、替换为零，或虚构维度和参考系来掩盖解释不完整。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/reclassificationPassConfidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link the actual Quantity and retain original finite numeric literals unchanged on math:quantityValue, allowing equal numeric lexical aliases. Reuse Quantity's inherited dimension obligations and keep one actual complete ReferenceFrame. Retain the pass-specific interpretation without asserting probability, rank, calibration or a decision threshold."
msgstr "关联实际 Quantity，在 math:quantityValue 上原样保留原始有限数值字面量，允许数值相等的词法形式。复用 Quantity 继承的维度要求，并保留一个实际完整 ReferenceFrame。保留过程专属解释，不断言概率、排名、校准或决策阈值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReclassificationPassConfidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Reclassification pass confidence constraint"
msgstr "重分类过程原始置信数值约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReclassificationPassConfidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each supplied reclassification pass-confidence Quantity has at least one original valid finite numeric magnitude, one numeric value and exactly one typed complete ReferenceFrame; existing Quantity dimension obligations remain inherited."
msgstr "每个已提供的重分类过程原始置信数值 Quantity 都至少具有一个原始有效有限数值、唯一数值及恰好一个具有类型的完整 ReferenceFrame；继续继承 Quantity 现有维度要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReclassificationPassConfidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Six independent positive magnitude/frame obligations preserve original numeric identity and equal lexical aliases. No dimension law is duplicated, and these structural checks establish no probability bounds, calibration, source truth, execution or applicability of the declared interpretation."
msgstr "六项独立正向数值与参考系要求保留原始数值身份及相等词法形式。不重复维度定律；这些结构检查不确立概率范围、校准、来源真实性、执行情况或所声明解释的适用性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReclassificationPassConfidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A supplied finite score is checked in its actual frame while a reading with no raw score acquires neither a default value nor a probability interpretation."
msgstr "在实际参考系中检查已提供有限分数；未提供原始分数的解读不获得默认值或概率解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReclassificationPassConfidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to validate the supplied raw pass-confidence quantities of extraction reclassification readings without requiring a score on every reading."
msgstr "用于验证提取重分类解读提供的过程原始置信数值量，不要求每个解读都提供分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReclassificationPassConfidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using a passing structural result as source authentication, normalized confidence, successful reclassification, evidence of a model run or permission to invent missing dimension and frame context."
msgstr "避免将结构检查通过视为来源认证、归一化置信度、成功重分类、模型运行证据，或允许虚构缺失维度与参考系上下文的依据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReclassificationPassConfidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Apply the reading type guard and six independently positive score guards with fresh local variables and atomic existence probes. Check every original magnitude for finite numeric validity and numeric equality, require one actual typed frame, and leave exact dimension presence, type and uniqueness to the existing Math Quantity owner."
msgstr "应用解读类型守卫及六个独立正向分数守卫，使用互不冲突的局部变量和原子存在性探测。检查每个原始数值的有限有效性及数值相等，要求一个实际具型参考系，并由现有 Math Quantity 所属模型约束维度的存在、类型及唯一性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ReclassificationPassConfidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/message"
msgid "Each supplied reclassification pass-confidence Quantity has at least one original valid finite numeric magnitude, one numeric value and exactly one typed complete ReferenceFrame; existing Quantity dimension obligations remain inherited."
msgstr "每个已提供的重分类过程原始置信数值 Quantity 都至少具有一个原始有效有限数值、唯一数值及恰好一个具有类型的完整 ReferenceFrame；继续继承 Quantity 现有维度要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ocrSourceImageDigest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "OCR source-image digest"
msgstr "OCR 来源图像摘要"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ocrSourceImageDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A supplied algorithm-typed digest of the exact identified image byte representation from which this ContentBlock’s text was read by OCR, retained as the source’s attributed claim."
msgstr "来源提供的、以算法为数据类型的摘要，其原像为通过 OCR 读取此 ContentBlock 文本所依据图像的确切已标明字节表示；该摘要作为归属于来源的声明保留。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ocrSourceImageDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Optional and nonfunctional. Its preimage belongs to the OCR source image representation, not this block’s own bytes. Several source claims and algorithms may coexist without creating or identifying image resources or pairing their values."
msgstr "此属性可选且非函数式。其原像属于 OCR 来源图像表示，而非此块自身的字节。多项来源声明及多种算法可以共存，但不会创建或识别图像资源，也不会将各值相互配对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ocrSourceImageDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "A source reports a SHA-256 digest of the exact cropped image file used to read one block’s text; retain that supplied sha256Digest literal and the source’s crop and encoding evidence."
msgstr "来源报告了用于读取某块文本的确切裁剪图像文件的 SHA-256 摘要；保留所提供的 sha256Digest 字面量，以及来源关于裁剪和编码的证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ocrSourceImageDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the source establishes the block’s OCR-input relation and supplies a digest with its actual algorithm construction and exact identified image byte preimage."
msgstr "用于来源确立块与 OCR 输入的关系，并提供摘要、实际算法构造及确切已标明图像字节原像时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ocrSourceImageDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid for the block’s own contentDigest, an unknown algorithm or preimage, a perceptual or scheme identifier, inferred image identity, or a claim that OCR or byte verification has been independently established."
msgstr "避免用于块自身的 contentDigest、算法或原像不明的值、感知标识符或方案标识符、推断出的图像身份，或声称 OCR 及字节验证已获独立证实。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ocrSourceImageDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the supplied complete blake3_256Digest, sha256Digest or md5Digest term and its exact lowercase spelling on the actual ContentBlock. Retain the actual algorithm construction, byte representation, OCR-input evidence and exact-statement attribution; reject missing or invalid selected evidence without normalization, retyping, defaults or a weaker string."
msgstr "在实际 ContentBlock 上保留来源提供的完整 blake3_256Digest、sha256Digest 或 md5Digest 项及其确切小写拼写。保留实际算法构造、字节表示、OCR 输入证据及确切语句的归属；若所选证据缺失或无效，须予以拒绝，不得规范化、改换类型、采用默认值或退为较弱的字符串。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OcrSourceImageDigestValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "OCR source-image digest admission"
msgstr "OCR 来源图像摘要准入校验"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OcrSourceImageDigestValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every supplied ocrSourceImageDigest has the exact algorithm datatype and bare lowercase hexadecimal width: blake3_256Digest or sha256Digest with 64 digits, or md5Digest with 32 digits."
msgstr "每个来源提供的 ocrSourceImageDigest 均须采用确切的算法数据类型及规定长度的无前缀小写十六进制形式：blake3_256Digest 或 sha256Digest 含 64 个数字，md5Digest 含 32 个数字。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OcrSourceImageDigestValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This is supplied-value datatype and lexical admission. It computes no hash and certifies neither source content, the image preimage, OCR execution nor digest agreement. The provided-value endpoint checks independently require an actual ContentBlock subject."
msgstr "此约束只校验来源提供值的数据类型及词法形式，不计算哈希，也不认证来源内容、图像原像、OCR 执行或摘要一致性。提供值的端点校验另行要求主体为实际 ContentBlock。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OcrSourceImageDigestValueConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "An xsd:string of 64 lowercase hexadecimal digits fails the algorithm contract; a sha256Digest value with uppercase digits fails the lexical contract."
msgstr "由 64 个小写十六进制数字组成的 xsd:string 不符合算法契约；含大写数字的 sha256Digest 值不符合词法契约。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OcrSourceImageDigestValueConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to admit each supplied OCR source-image digest only under its explicitly supplied algorithm datatype and exact hexadecimal width."
msgstr "用于仅按明确提供的算法数据类型及确切十六进制长度，准入校验每个来源提供的 OCR 来源图像摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OcrSourceImageDigestValueConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating lexical acceptance as source verification, using an untyped fallback, normalizing invalid values, deriving an algorithm from width or requiring a digest on every block."
msgstr "避免将词法通过视为来源已验证、采用无算法类型的回退、规范化无效值、根据长度推导算法，或要求每个块都带摘要。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OcrSourceImageDigestValueConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select the actual ocrSourceImageDigest relation, bind its subject and value positively, and require one complete datatype-and-width branch using termSameComponent and termRegex. Reject a failed branch union without replacing the supplied term; keep the actual byte and OCR-source evidence separately."
msgstr "选择实际 ocrSourceImageDigest 关系，通过正向关系绑定其主体和值，并以 termSameComponent 和 termRegex 要求满足一个完整的数据类型及长度分支。若分支并集不成立，须予以拒绝，不替换来源项；另行保留实际字节及 OCR 来源证据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/OcrSourceImageDigestValueConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/message"
msgid "Every supplied ocrSourceImageDigest has the exact algorithm datatype and bare lowercase hexadecimal width: blake3_256Digest or sha256Digest with 64 digits, or md5Digest with 32 digits."
msgstr "每个来源提供的 ocrSourceImageDigest 均须采用确切的算法数据类型及规定长度的无前缀小写十六进制形式：blake3_256Digest 或 sha256Digest 含 64 个数字，md5Digest 含 32 个数字。"
